Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:29.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I got nothing, sir.\NNo sign of Niobe or Ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Nothing but blue pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Should we try to contact them?\N- Won't matter. My gut says they're down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- We should start back.\N- If that ship can fly, we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Search every pipe, every hole,\Nevery crack we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sweep as wide as possible,\Nas fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:02.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Lines are crawling with calamari.\N- The sooner we find them the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Thought you could use something to eat.\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.99,0:44:55.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Any change?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.62,1:12:01.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:59.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How is he?\N- He's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,At least until he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:05.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean?\N- Captain has some questions for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:15.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He'd better have some good answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:47.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You see these cuts?\NI think they're self-inflicted.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.71,1:19:05.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- VDTs maybe. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But like I said,\Nthe answer better be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.24,1:01:32.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Roland, I'd like to run another search\Nthrough the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.79,0:46:23.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- For what?\N- For Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How could he be in the Matrix, sir?\NHe's not plugged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:41.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Please, for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.72,1:35:16.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is what keeps bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,His neural patterns don't read\Nlike someone who's in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The strange thing is,\NI see these patterns all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Where?\N- On someone jacked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The big bupkes. Nada.\NHe's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:45.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Sir, I got the projections.\N- How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:11.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Based on point of entry and the past speed,\Nthe machines will be in Zion in 20 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:26.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Jesus H. Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:55.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move with a purpose.\NAK, I want you on holographics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Mauser, I want forward and aft guns\Nmanned at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And make sure we are running\Non as few pads as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:31.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Hey! You got a call.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.24,1:47:24.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:20.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's Seraph.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.05,1:35:17.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I bring word from the Oracle.\NYou must come at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- My name is Sati. Your name is Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,My papa says you're not supposed\Nto be here. He says you must be lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.22,1:58:16.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are you lost, Neo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Where am I?\N- This is the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:45.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- This isn't the Matrix?\N- That's where the train goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's where we're going,\Nbut you cannot go with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:50.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why not?\N- He won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who won't?\N- The Trainman. I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But my papa says we have to do\Nwhat the Trainman says...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:40.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...or else he will leave us here\Nforever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, Trinity,\Nthank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:55.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,One thing I've learned in all my years...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...is that nothing ever works out\Nthe way you want it to.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.34,1:51:56.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- I'm the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.22,1:29:02.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I wish there was an easy way to get\Nthrough this, but there ain't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.44,1:13:11.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.17,1:17:08.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't be sitting here\Nlike you remember me...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.80,1:19:12.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...but it wasn't meant to be.\N- What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I made a choice, and that choice\Ncost me more than I wanted it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:18.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To help you, to guide Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now, since the real test for any choice\Nis having to make the same choice again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...knowing full well\Nwhat it might cost...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I guess I feel pretty good\Nabout that choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...because here I am, at it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.41,1:03:46.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Do you know what happened to Neo?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:42.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He is trapped in a place between\Nthis world and the machine world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The link is controlled by a program\Ncalled the Trainman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He uses it to smuggle programs\Nin and out of the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If he finds out where Neo is\Nbefore you get to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...then I'm afraid our choices\Nare going to become difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Because of who the Trainman works for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Merovingian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He has placed a bounty on your lives.\NYou must be careful at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Seraph knows how to find the Trainman.\NHe'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,For years he has protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I hope he can do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Please, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.53,1:07:04.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oracle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:40.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know, Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:43.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can see you're filled with doubt,\Nclouded by uncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,After everything that has happened,\Nhow can you expect me to believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:16.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I expect just what I've always expected:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,For you to make up your own damn mind.\NBelieve me or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,All I can do is tell you that your friend\Nis in trouble, and he needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He needs all our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:01.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Are you from the Matrix?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I mean, I was.\N- Why did you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I had to.\N- I had to leave my home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sati! Come here, darling.\NLeave the poor man in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I am sorry. She is still very curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.64,0:49:26.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I know you.\N- Yes, in the restaurant of the Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I am Rama-Kandra. This is my wife,\NKamala. My daughter, Sati.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:21.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We are most honored to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:32.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You are programs.\N- Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:24.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I am the power-plant systems manager\Nfor recycling operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:21.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,My wife is an interactive software\Nprogrammer. She is highly creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.78,0:35:55.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?\NYou do not belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Kamala! Goodness, I apologize.\NMy wife can be very direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:29.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't have an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.87,1:39:57.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I don't even know where "here" is.\N- This place is nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:27.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is between your world and our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who's the Trainman?\N- He works for the Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:28.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why did I know you would say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:45.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Frenchman does not forget,\Nand he does not forgive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.04,1:15:41.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You know him?\N- I know only what I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know that if you want to take something\Nfrom our world into your world...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...that does not belong there,\Nyou must go to the Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:39.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:43.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Rama, please.\N- I do not want to be cruel, Kamala.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He may never see another face\Nfor the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.27,1:13:53.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You don't have to answer that question.\N- No, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:28.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The answer is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:01.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I love my daughter very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I find her to be the most beautiful thing\NI have ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But where we are from,\Nthat is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Every program that is created\Nmust have a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If it does not, it is deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:58.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I went to the Frenchman\Nto save my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You do not understand.\N- I just have never...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Heard a program speak of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- It is a human emotion.\N- No, it is a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What matters is the connection\Nthe word implies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:55.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I see that you are in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what you would give\Nto hold on to that connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps the reason you are here is not\Nso different than the reason I am here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.24,1:51:31.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Get away! Get away from me!\N- We don't want trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Get the hell away from me!\N- We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.65,1:54:20.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can't help you!\NNo one can help you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.24,1:19:38.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- When is the train due?\N- It is already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's not like the Trainman to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.43,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You think it has something to do with me?\N- I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:34.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Who knows such things?\NOnly the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.46,1:08:48.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You know the Oracle?\N- Everyone knows the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:50.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I consulted with her\Nbefore I met with the Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,She promised to watch Sati\Nafter we said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.71,1:26:09.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You're not staying with her?\N- It is not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Our arrangement with the Frenchman\Nwas for our daughter only.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:37.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- My wife and I must return to our world.\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:20.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- That is our karma.\N- You believe in karma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:32.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Karma is a word, like love.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,A way of saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:16.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,"What I am here to do."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I do not resent my karma.\NI'm grateful for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:43.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Grateful for my wonderful wife,\Nfor my beautiful daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:20.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They are gifts, and so I do\Nwhat I must do to honor them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Papa, the train!\N- Yes. Find your bag. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:07.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can I carry that for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:06.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up, I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:13.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- He is a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.90,1:12:36.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- So that's what they wanted.\N- I need to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,One way or another,\NI'm getting on this train.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.59,2:00:58.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You'll stay here until\Nthe Merovingian says different.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.98,1:34:44.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If I know him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...you're gonna be here\Nfor a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I don't want to hurt you.\N- You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:23.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I built this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Down here, I make the rules.\NDown here, I make the threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Down here, I'm God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get on the train\Nor you'll stay here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We should return to the Oracle.\NShe will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No. We know what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:55.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:17.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, it's wingless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You must be ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:29.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I need to speak with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Only way you're getting through this door\Nis over my big, dead ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:21.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:45.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There are no weapons allowed\Nin the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,At the bottom of this elevator,\Nthere is a coat-check girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and if we are lucky,\None man for checking weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:51.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if we're unlucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:41.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There will be many men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can I take your...? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:19.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:41.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.37,0:24:10.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.89,0:18:22.02,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The prodigal child returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are you here for the bounty, Seraph?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how many bullets\Nare there in those guns?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.26,1:35:13.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I don't think\Nyou have enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:04.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- We only want to talk.\N- Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you do. You have fought\Nthrough Hel to do so. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:09.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Put down the guns, and I will promise you\Na safe passage out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- All three of us?\N- Oh, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:47.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Who could have guessed we would see\Neach other so soon after our last meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Fates are too kind, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:19.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And since you, my little Judas,\Nhave brought them here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:36.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I can only surmise that the fortuneteller\Nhas found herself another shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:06.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Disappointing, but not unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:16.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I do hope, however, she has the good\Nmanners to learn her lesson...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:54.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and to remember that there is\Nno action without consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if you take something from me,\Nyou will pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:50.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You know why we are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come now, what kind of question is this?\NOf course I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is my business to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:25.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Some might think this is a strange\Ncoincidence, but I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:49.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I am curious, though,\Nas to how it actually happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:57.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Do you know?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:45.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I did not think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But it is always best to ask, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We want to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.29,1:15:34.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Always straight to business,\Nhuh, Morpheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.52,0:54:26.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Okay. I have something you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:05.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To make a deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:09.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...you must have something\NI want, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And it so happens\Nthere is something I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:48.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Something I have wanted\Never since I first came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:07.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is said they cannot be taken...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:22.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...they can only be given.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:18.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:26.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The eyes of the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I told you before, there is no escaping\Nthe nature of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:35.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is that nature\Nthat has again brought you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Where some see coincidence,\NI see consequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.89,1:01:56.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Where others see chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I see cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:16.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Bring me the eyes of the Oracle...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and I will give you back your savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It seems a perfectly fair\Nand reasonable deal to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.20,1:39:53.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:24.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.01,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You wanna make a deal?\NHow about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You give me Neo, or we all die,\Nright here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.32,1:03:44.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Interesting deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:22.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You are really ready to die\Nfor this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:20.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Believe it.\N- She'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:58.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If she has to,\Nshe'll kill every one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,She's in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is remarkable how similar the pattern\Nof love is to the pattern of insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:58.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be, Merv?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.85,1:04:51.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Okay. You got yourself in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...you can get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:11.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:09.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Almost, sir. They got\Nsome pretty ancient hacks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- But you found Neo?\N- Can't you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, sir. We read something,\Nbut I couldn't tell what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:13.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I have to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:45.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's my last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.10,1:52:03.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's it. That's the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You've got to use your hands.\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Cookies need love like everything does.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:07.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:21.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to have these done\Nbefore you got here. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.38,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sati, honey, I think it's time\Nfor a tasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Take the bowl to Seraph\Nand find out if they're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.29,1:14:54.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:03.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I'm glad you got out.\N- Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So do you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- A part of you.\N- Yeah, that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:21.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Some bits you lose,\Nsome bits you keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.05,1:15:04.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't yet recognize my face\Nin the mirror...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:55.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...but I still love candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.44,1:26:24.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Remember how you were\Nwhen you first walked through my door?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Jittery as a June bug.\NAnd now, just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:13.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You sure did surprise me, Neo,\Nand you still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:01.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You gave me a few surprises too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.93,0:26:34.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I hope I helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You helped me to get here,\Nbut my question is, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.99,0:26:53.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Where is this going?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.59,1:58:11.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Where does it end?\N- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:41.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You don't know or you won't tell me?\N- I told you before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...no one can see beyond a choice\Nthey don't understand, and I mean no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What choice?\N- It doesn't matter. It's my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.21,0:24:19.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I have mine to make,\Nsame as you have yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.45,0:25:31.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Does that include what things\Nto tell me and what not to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:07.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Of course not.\N- Why didn't you tell me about the Architect?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.69,0:28:10.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,About Zion and the ones before me?\NWhy didn't you tell me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Because it wasn't time for you to know.\N- Who decided it wasn't time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:31.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.74,0:42:57.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:34.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Then I think it's time for me to know\Na few more things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:48.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.69,0:25:58.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Tell me how I separated my mind\Nfrom my body without jacking in.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.65,1:59:08.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Tell me how I stopped four sentinels\Nby thinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.69,0:26:40.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Tell me just what the hell\Nis happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:18.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The power of the One\Nextends beyond this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:02.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It reaches from here all the way back\Nto where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Where?\N- The source.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.81,0:24:39.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's what you felt when you touched\Nthose sentinels, but you weren't ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.87,0:25:34.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You should be dead, but apparently\Nyou weren't ready for that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:29.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Architect said that if I didn't return to\Nthe source, Zion would be destroyed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Please. You and I may not be able\Nto see beyond our own choices...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.13,0:27:11.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...but that man can't see\Npast any choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:04.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why not?\N- He doesn't understand them. He can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:25.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To him, they are variables\Nin an equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:05.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,One at a time, each variable\Nmust be solved, then countered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's his purpose.\NTo balance the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:06.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What's your purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.14,0:26:38.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To unbalance it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.75,0:58:19.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:18.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I want the same thing you want, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:54.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And I'm willing to go\Nas far as you are to get it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.38,2:03:36.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The end of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:44.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Is it going to end?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:00.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,One way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:09.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can Zion be saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:58.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't have the answer\Nto that question, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.10,0:46:02.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If there is an answer, there's only\None place you're going to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:58.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Where?\N- You know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.70,0:27:35.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if you can't find the answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.17,0:27:47.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...then I'm afraid there may be\Nno tomorrow for any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:30.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Everything that has a beginning...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.02,0:40:38.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...has an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:53.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I see the end coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:08.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I see the darkness spreading.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:48.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I see death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And you are all that stands in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.73,0:27:27.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Very soon, he is going to have the power\Nto destroy this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I believe he won't stop there.\NHe can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:14.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He won't stop until\Nthere's nothing left at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.04,0:27:45.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:04.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.09,0:28:31.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Your opposite, your negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:55.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The result of the equation\Ntrying to balance itself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:01.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- And if I can't stop him?\N- One way or another, Neo...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:28.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...this war is going to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the future of both worlds\Nwill be in your hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:21.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...or in his.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.92,0:27:07.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?\NAre you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.85,1:47:54.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:32.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- That figures.\N- Captain Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:13.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What's up, Maggie?\N- Bane is. He's conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Good. Maybe he's got some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.63,0:29:17.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I love that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:32.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I sure am going to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.00,0:35:26.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Oracle.\N- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.91,0:53:20.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:09.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sati, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.46,0:29:04.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Take a few cookies and go with Seraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:27.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can I come back?\NI would like to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.31,0:28:04.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I would like that too.\N- Then I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.14,0:35:35.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I hope so, hon, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:42.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Seraph.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:29.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:59.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He's following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Well, well, it's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.99,0:28:19.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I remember chasing you\Nwas like chasing a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.04,0:28:23.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I have beaten you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes, true, but as you can see,\Nthings are a little different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:08.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And you must be the last exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:23.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- The Oracle told me about you.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:47.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What did she say about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:43.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That you were a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.54,0:29:10.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not so bad,\Nonce you get to know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:00.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The great and powerful Oracle,\Nwe meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I suppose you've been\Nexpecting me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:40.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The all-knowing Oracle is never surprised.\NHow can she be? She knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:11.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But if that's true, then why is she here\Nif she knew I was coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.51,1:36:00.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't she leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:20.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Maybe you knew I would do that,\Nmaybe you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:52.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If you did, that means you baked those\Ncookies and set that plate there...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.76,0:34:23.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...deliberately, purposefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...which means that you're sitting there\Nalso deliberately, purposefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.56,1:44:24.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What did you do with Sati?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:45.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,"Cookies need love\Nlike everything does."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:34.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You are a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:38.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You would know, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.37,0:35:16.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do what you're here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:55.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:16.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could help, but I just...\NI don't remember any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:27.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What about the cuts on your arms?\NThose cuts are more than one day old.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.61,0:35:49.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.30,0:37:34.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You're right about that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.93,0:39:42.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They look like they might be self-inflicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.91,0:36:00.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But why would I do something\Nlike that to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.97,0:37:40.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, I wasn't myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:49.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But if I'm not me, then who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:45.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Has this man been tested for VDTs?\N- Yes, sir. It was negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:54.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But he is showing a lot\Nof unusual neural activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.82,0:35:53.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Some cross-synaptic firing,\Nas well as signs of recent trauma...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.79,0:35:18.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...with fresh fibrotic scarring\Nthroughout the cortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.12,0:35:21.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I want the truth. I don't care\Nwhat it takes. Make him remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:23.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sir, we found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:12.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- The Logos?\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.48,0:39:50.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,About time we had\Nsome goddamn good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.68,0:35:37.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are the thermals picking up\Nany signs of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.92,0:31:55.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, sir. Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.33,0:37:25.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What about the ship?\N- Holographic says the hull's still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.09,0:32:04.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Drop down and keep a man in the turret.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:09.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get a full diagnostic on that ship\Nas fast as humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.39,0:38:17.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Careful, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:54.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The squids are sneaky bastards.\NIt could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:40.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can put that shit away, boys.\NAll she needs is a jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Niobe.\N- Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right?\N- Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:27.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We didn't know what happened after...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:30.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.65,0:37:48.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.40,0:38:34.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Did you get Neo out?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.36,1:13:18.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How did you know about that?\N- The Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.28,0:37:59.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You saw her?\N- Just before the sentinels found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.04,0:38:06.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What did she tell you?\N- The same thing she always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.27,0:39:09.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I needed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,In 12 hours, the machines\Nwill breach the dock walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Every simulation we've run, we've seen\Nthat once the machines are inside the city...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.21,0:39:34.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...the odds of our survival\Ndecrease dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.03,0:42:07.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Thus, our primary objective must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.67,0:38:18.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...to destroy or disable the diggers\Ninside the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:42.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If we can do that, perhaps we can prevent\Nthem from ever reaching the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:58.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If not, the only place we will be able\Nto mount a defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.61,0:39:56.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...will be at the entrance of the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.59,0:37:36.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is small and will force\Nthem into a bottleneck...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.73,0:39:16.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...allowing us to concentrate\Nthe remainder of our defense.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.05,2:00:57.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We understand that you've requested\Nadditional volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.19,0:39:53.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.99,0:38:37.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Precisely what size force are you planning\Nto commit to the primary dock objective?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Right now, the entire APU Corps\Nand half the infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:45.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Half the infantry?\N- If it were up to me, councillor...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:08.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I'd take every man, woman and child,\Nput a gun in their hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.28,0:41:26.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and march them into that dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.62,1:39:47.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is best\Nthat it is not up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Time will tell, councillor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.13,0:40:27.01,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Commander, just one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:46.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Has there been word\Nfrom the Nebuchadnezza?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.88,0:37:30.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,None, and at this point there's no reason\Nto expect there will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.97,0:40:44.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.59,0:39:37.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But we can hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.48,0:37:51.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid hope is an indulgence\NI don't have time for.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.19,1:35:30.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Zee, what are you doing?\N- Making shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.85,0:41:13.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They're evacuating our level.\NWe have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:47.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I'm not going with you.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.62,0:40:55.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They've called for volunteers\Nto hold the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.74,0:38:45.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Kids, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.75,0:40:18.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel,\Nbut you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.05,1:36:32.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I have to.\N- Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.58,0:43:00.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Because I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:57.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I love him the same as he loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.83,0:40:15.38,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if I were out there and he were here,\NI know what he'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:20.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But you're gonna get yourself killed.\NIt's crazy, Zee.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.44,0:39:59.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is. But ask yourself,\Nif it were Dozer...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.47,0:40:22.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and you knew the only chance you had\Nto see him was to hold the dock...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.18,0:40:33.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:54.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Make shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:16.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What the shit is going on over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.34,0:43:11.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,An accident, sir. I didn't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.83,0:41:34.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:31.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,A unit volunteer, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.83,0:40:53.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What's a pod-born pencil-neck like you\Ndoing volunteering for my Corps?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:51.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I want to do my part, sir.\NWe gotta hold the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.73,0:44:08.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How old are you, kid?\N- Eighteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:34.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Should have said 16,\NI might have believed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:14.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:22.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Minimum age for the Corps is 18.\NSixteen's too young.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:02.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The machines don't care how old I am.\NThey'll kill me just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.19,0:59:24.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Ain't that the goddamn truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.79,0:42:21.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance, sir.\NI won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:34.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You do, and you'll find me and the machines\Nhave got something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.42,0:41:47.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Okay, charge the igniter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:05.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,She lives again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:06.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You want to reload\Nthe operations software, Sparky?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Could you clean the windshield\Nwhile you're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.94,0:44:10.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Uplinks in place.\NI'm bringing her back online.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.18,0:46:47.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Looking good, except...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.59,0:43:03.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong\Nwith the Matrix feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.90,0:42:42.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, there's not. You're looking\Nat what we're looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:13.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,-What's going on in there?\N- Whatever it is, it can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:41.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The machines have taken Junction 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:19.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, if we drop down\Nfrom broadcast here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:43.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...intersect 153, we might surprise them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:30.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We'll go first, hammer as deep as we can,\Nthen blow our EMP.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we can punch a hole\Nbig enough for you to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.68,0:43:54.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It ain't pretty, but the way I see it,\Nit's the only way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.44,0:40:44.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:40.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There's another way. A support line.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It drops down right here,\N1000 meters short of 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.18,0:41:55.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If we're lucky, we may be able to slip down\Nwithout them ever knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.29,0:43:43.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's a mechanical line.\NIt's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.17,0:41:43.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- No one can pilot a mechanical.\N- I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.09,0:43:48.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Bullshit.\N- I've done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:19.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- That was a long time ago, Niobe.\N- I said I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.90,0:42:46.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So what? You'll be the only one that can.\NThere's no way we can follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.94,0:32:15.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know time is always against us.\NI'm sorry that I took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.05,0:44:35.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- But I wanted to be sure.\N- Sure of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.98,0:44:46.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I know what I have to do.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.95,0:44:58.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There's no easy way to say this,\Nso I'll just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.94,0:44:48.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I have to take one of the ships.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:14.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:26.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To the machine city.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.08,0:45:03.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know it's difficult to understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.86,1:29:15.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, it's not. You're out\Nof your goddamn mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.55,0:45:20.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I still have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,In 100 years, no ship has been\Nwithin 100 kilometers of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.93,0:44:40.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You'll never make it.\N- I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.98,0:44:42.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Is this what the Oracle has told you?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.72,0:45:23.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is asinine. If you want\Nto kill yourself, do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.97,0:45:16.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...but do it without\Nwasting our ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.53,1:35:34.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You have to believe me. I have to go.\N- Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.32,0:41:29.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I am the captain of this ship.\NI say where it has to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:51.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And this ship will go to hell\Nlong before I let you take it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.94,0:44:04.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- He can take mine.\N- You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.29,0:45:01.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Don't try to tell me\Nwhat I can or cannot do...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:03.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...with my ship\Nafter that little speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.40,0:45:28.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- But for chrissake, Niobe...\N- I'll pilot this ship, he can take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.78,0:44:52.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If we leave inside the hour,\Nwe should reach Zion as the machines do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:46:00.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's as good a plan as any.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.44,1:26:28.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's a waste. A goddamn waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Two ships, two directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.07,0:46:19.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sounds like providence,\Ndoesn't it, Morpheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.73,0:45:31.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You've never believed in the One.\N- I still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:07.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Then why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:10.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.78,0:46:58.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.87,0:46:27.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What's that for?\N- To help you relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.77,0:46:49.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To make it easier for you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.36,0:46:51.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What if I don't want to remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.89,0:47:30.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why would you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.02,0:47:37.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What if I blew that EMP?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.40,0:46:55.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What if I did destroy those ships...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.82,0:45:35.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...and I am responsible\Nfor the deaths of all those men?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:12.38,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If I did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.24,0:45:38.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...it wouldn't be very safe\Nfor me here, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.83,0:45:47.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Of course, it might not be\Nvery safe for you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.91,0:48:33.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:47.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trinity...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.09,0:47:19.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...there's something I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.47,0:48:02.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Something you need to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.36,0:47:43.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know I'm supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.71,0:49:23.43,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But beyond that...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.32,1:14:02.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I don't know. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:53.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know. You don't think\Nyou're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.63,0:30:36.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I knew it the moment you said you had\Nto leave. I could see it in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.55,0:45:53.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Just like you knew the moment you looked\Nat me that I was coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Trin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.44,0:48:18.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.37,0:47:44.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It took me 10 minutes\Nto buckle up one boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.45,0:48:30.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.83,0:47:07.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Six hours ago, I told the Merovingian...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.10,0:47:27.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I was ready to give anything\Nand everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.41,0:47:09.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's changed\Nin the last six hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.61,0:53:16.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.21,0:54:56.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.26,0:48:04.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,-Finished loading ammunition?\N- Just about.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.55,0:45:54.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Let's move it. We are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:48.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving them anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.15,1:09:05.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He said he didn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.45,0:49:07.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I ain't saying goodbye.\NI'm saying good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.94,0:48:52.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.93,0:49:25.43,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can only hope you know\Nwhat you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:31.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.06,0:48:55.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It was an honor, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.55,0:47:15.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, the honor is still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.08,0:47:05.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,-We're ready, sir.\N- About damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:14.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We're already late, captain,\Nso let's hit it and hit it hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.87,0:50:11.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Bye, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.22,1:45:48.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Take good care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.18,0:56:26.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.91,0:47:51.63,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Engine's still firing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.00,2:03:31.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Must be a fuse. I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.54,0:45:44.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I should've known he'd send his bitch first.\N- Bane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No one ever got away from me\Nas many times as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.85,0:47:24.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Every time, I thought it was the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.72,0:49:28.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Every time, I was sure we had you,\Nbut you'd slip through our fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.87,0:47:47.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I really can't express\Njust how aggravating that can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.36,0:51:50.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.34,0:49:19.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I think I might enjoy killing you\Nas much as killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.71,0:53:23.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo, it's Bane. He's psychotic!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.76,0:49:29.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.88,0:53:28.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Twenty-seven kilometers to go.\N-We got an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.05,1:18:31.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What is it, AK?\N-It's Maggie, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:52.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,She's dead, murdered.\NI think it was Bane.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:04.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.98,1:51:29.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I knew it. I knew he was\Nout of his goddamn mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.14,0:54:23.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He fired that EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:36.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it, I should have\Nbeaten it out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.11,0:47:39.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We searched the whole ship, captain.\NHe ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.55,0:47:58.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I know where he is.\N- The Logos.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.22,1:29:42.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- We gotta go back.\N- Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:53.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What if they need our help?\N- It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:16.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Because if he's killed them...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:31.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...he'll control another EMP.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.13,0:48:36.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,At this point, they're on their own.\NJust like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.95,0:40:06.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I see you are as predictable in this world\Nas you are in the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:25.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- He's out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.53,1:54:24.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It might appear that way.\NBut Mr. Anderson and I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.15,0:52:33.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...that appearances can be deceiving.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.03,1:55:45.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Confused, Mr. Anderson?\NIt'll all become clear in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.31,0:50:18.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me the gun.\NYou can set it down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:43.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.17,0:52:04.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Shoot. Shoot now.\N- Yes, shoot. Fry us. Burn us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.61,0:51:42.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do it. If you don't, he'll kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.38,0:52:49.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Look at him. He knows\Nhe should do it, but he won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.45,0:51:59.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- He can't.\N- Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:50.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Back away from the gun\Nand turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.83,0:59:35.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.09,0:54:19.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Somehow familiar, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.90,0:50:20.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We've been here before,\Nyou and I, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.84,0:47:22.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I do. I think of nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.50,0:52:42.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- Still don't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.29,0:49:14.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I admit, it is difficult to even think\Nencased in this rotting piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:03.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The stink of it filling every breath,\Na suffocating cloud you can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.37,1:40:29.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.29,0:49:17.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Look at how pathetically fragile it is.\NNothing this weak is meant to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.21,0:52:45.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What do you want?\N- I want what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's it, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.54,0:55:29.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Look past the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:08.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Look through the soft gelatin of these\Ndull cow eyes and see your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.66,0:55:24.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- Oh, yes, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.15,0:54:29.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- It can't be.\N- There's nowhere I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.17,0:55:31.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There is nowhere I won't find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.59,0:56:22.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- It's impossible.\N- Not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.16,1:58:00.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.97,1:27:38.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.43,0:49:33.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is it. It's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.98,0:54:32.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.50,0:56:16.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I wish you could see yourself,\NMr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.19,0:56:37.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Blind messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.58,0:48:34.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You're a symbol for all of your kind,\NMr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.87,0:56:49.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.34,0:56:54.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:54.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Just waiting to be put out\Nof your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:47.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:39.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's not over, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.04,0:56:13.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.24,0:50:29.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Trinity!\N- Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.90,0:56:37.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:27.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.58,0:56:07.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.68,0:55:00.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Trin.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:25.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I think you're gonna have to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.95,0:56:50.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Seismic's projecting 22 minutes to breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.79,0:56:53.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They can't know we don't have an EMP.\NThey'll have to attack in waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.63,0:55:34.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Concentrate our offense on the diggers.\NOrder the APUs into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.72,1:09:44.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.43,0:54:25.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come on, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.98,0:57:53.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:53.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:18.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now, you all know me,\Nso I'll just say this as simple as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.19,0:56:40.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If it's our time to die, it's our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.00,0:56:55.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,All I ask is, if we have\Nto give these bastards our lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:43.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...we give them hell before we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.94,0:59:47.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.85,0:57:13.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You scared, Charra?\N- Shit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.37,0:57:34.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.99,0:58:10.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You keep loading, I keep shooting.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.78,1:04:23.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.63,0:54:59.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Holy Christ, would you look at that.\N- Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How far to the opening?\N- 1.4 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.33,0:57:38.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- We're still generating too hot a field.\N- Ghost, kill all auxiliary systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:08.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Give me full manual. Drop down four pads.\N- It'll bottom out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.31,1:01:27.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Easy, baby.\N- Seven hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.03,0:46:17.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If we can just get close enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.86,1:59:11.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Six hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.47,1:00:34.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.33,1:01:16.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:43.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Jig's up, here they come.\N- Give me full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.29,0:56:57.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Man the gun turrets,\Nevery goddamn one of them. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.82,0:52:36.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Ghost, you're the best gunner,\Ngo with them. Morpheus, take his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:46.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:00.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.97,0:57:04.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,-Slow down, this ain't theLogos.\N- Hang on to your lunch, Roland, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.49,0:57:26.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Holy Christ, I didn't know\Nthis ship could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.56,0:57:51.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Breach! The dock is breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.98,0:57:59.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Knuckle up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.55,0:57:00.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,For Zion!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.82,1:06:00.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.35,1:19:24.31,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.87,0:58:15.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Knuckle up!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.75,1:06:31.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Reload!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.85,1:06:34.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Reload nine!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.34,1:05:23.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Go, go! Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.68,1:00:36.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Watch your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.45,0:58:07.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Don't let them through!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Zuka!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.68,1:19:21.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.14,0:57:05.39,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Where the hell's my infantry?\NI want that goddamn machine taken down!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.73,0:59:26.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Dig this!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.94,1:08:24.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.22,1:58:54.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Bogey two at the breach point!\N- Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.84,0:58:22.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Shit, she's got a fat ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.13,0:57:02.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Keep them off me!\N- Christ, there's a shitstorm of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.77,0:57:17.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You see that?\N- They're after the radio. Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.89,1:59:42.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.85,1:10:55.31,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.42,1:03:54.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Grab my belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.04,1:02:30.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Just give me one clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:39.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.50,1:11:53.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Charra!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.55,0:57:46.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I got incoming!\N- We got a dock full of incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.15,0:58:42.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir. But this is different, sir.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.22,0:58:30.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I think it's one of ours, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.23,1:11:49.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- That's impossible.\N- Holographics are trying to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:25.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Contact them.\NI want access codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.10,0:58:32.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We're trying, sir.\NThere's no response.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.26,0:57:48.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's a trick. That's not one of ours,\Nit can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.73,0:58:44.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's a mechanical line.\NNo one can pilot mechanical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Forward aft, 30 degrees at 80 percent.\N- Thirty degrees, 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Lower starboard 60 degrees, 20 percent.\N- Sixty degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.27,1:23:41.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Shit! Come on, keep up!\N- I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.48,0:59:18.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sir, holographic confirms.\NIt's the Hammer,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.96,1:02:34.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's under attack, sustaining damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.49,1:00:07.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,At its present velocity,\Nit'll reach Gate Three in 12 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:10.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Their EMP could take out every sentinel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.87,0:58:53.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It'd take out more than that.\NIt'll wipe out our defense system.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.81,0:59:57.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We blow an EMP inside,\Nwe lose the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.23,0:58:04.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sir, we already lost the dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:19.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.96,1:03:50.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Gate Three is not responding!\NWe've taken critical damage, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:26.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We've lost control!\NWe can't open it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.84,1:00:28.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There's the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.07,0:58:50.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,On my mark, give me full power\N90 degrees to lower-left starboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.53,1:04:16.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Full power...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.70,1:14:00.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...ninety degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:05.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.41,1:01:42.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hold on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.42,1:01:49.38,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goddamn, woman, you can drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.22,1:03:18.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We ain't home yet.\NWhat about the gate?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.56,1:04:56.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sentinels are inside the dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:46.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are we too late?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.16,1:05:47.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How many APUs are operational?\N- Thirteen, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.66,1:00:12.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get me the one closest to Gate Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.56,1:15:37.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Reload!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:05:00.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He's pissing metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:21.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:24.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.28,1:07:44.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Heads up! They're coming around!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:18.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.39,1:05:31.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's jammed!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.75,0:58:58.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Forget it, kid! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.37,1:25:54.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:36.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Captain Mifune.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.10,0:59:19.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.01,1:04:40.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Hammer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.40,1:02:58.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.38,1:02:37.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You have to open that gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:16.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Cut the counterweights.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.47,0:58:35.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.78,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Hurry. There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.51,1:18:06.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.47,1:02:40.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...I didn't finish the training program.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.98,1:02:08.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.73,1:03:31.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Lock that down!\N- Kill the feeder!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.74,1:03:02.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We won't make it.\NWe gotta blow the EMP now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.92,1:39:23.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come on, someone, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.42,1:03:57.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Keep the weight forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.28,0:59:32.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Holographic reports Captain Mifune's APU\Nis up and moving to Gate Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.90,1:06:19.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Don't over-squeeze the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.62,1:06:33.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Mifune's APU just reached Gate Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.88,1:04:36.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- How much time?\N- Two minutes to impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.22,1:01:55.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Captain Mifune, do you copy?\N- I think his radio is down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.17,1:19:43.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Mifune...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.83,1:06:39.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...this is Lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:45.31,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you can hear me,\Nbut if you can...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:22.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,... theHammer's two minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.94,1:02:49.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You've got two minutes, captain,\Nto get that gate open.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:06.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Link.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.62,1:06:37.58,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get to the main deck!\NCharge the EMP!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.66,1:04:30.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.20,0:58:47.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo. I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.81,1:05:36.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- Can we make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.12,1:04:28.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We ain't come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.18,0:32:10.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Almost home, almost home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.65,1:05:45.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Burn it, Link!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.77,1:04:54.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- You did it.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.71,1:05:56.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.82,0:59:31.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You're a hell of a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.83,1:08:00.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Some things in this world never change.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:38.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But some things do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.46,1:22:19.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Luckily...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.06,1:13:50.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...some things do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.33,1:05:53.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Link!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.91,1:06:26.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Zee? Zee!\N- Link!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:42.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come. I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.15,1:01:30.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.14,1:04:07.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You did wear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.46,1:03:15.88,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?\NI'm never gonna take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.55,1:16:27.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Three captains, one ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.40,1:02:11.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I'll assume the other ships were lost\Nunder equally pointless circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.69,1:07:02.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Good to see you too, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.70,1:05:07.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Council's waiting to hear\Nan explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.66,0:58:08.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for not attending,\Nbut I have to try to salvage this debacle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.57,1:05:02.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?\NI thought we saved the dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.55,1:04:47.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's the problem with you people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:12.67,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can't think but five minutes\Nin front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.22,1:04:00.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That EMP knocked out almost every piece\Nof hardware and every APU.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.76,1:06:11.02,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If I were the machines,\NI'd send every sentinel here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.18,1:05:29.02,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Save the dock, captain?\NYou handed it to them on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.13,1:47:38.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Come on, get it cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.83,1:05:51.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The bridge is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.05,1:06:01.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.03,1:06:23.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get that cable run!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.79,1:05:58.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I want the system back online!\N- It's the dock. They've got incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.37,1:16:18.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Order everyone to fall back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.24,1:06:30.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Seal the shaft. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:38.31,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.49,1:08:38.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.78,1:09:51.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- All clear.\N- Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.16,1:07:14.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Go! Come on! Run!\N- Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.60,1:14:28.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.34,1:08:46.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,So you gave them your ship?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- That is correct, councillor, I did.\N- Knowing what he planned to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:39.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The Oracle said nothing of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.27,1:06:14.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,She told me Neo would need my help,\Nand I would choose to help him or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:06.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But what hope can a single vessel have\Nagainst their entire defense system?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.46,1:06:41.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,None. It's completely impossible.\NBut he wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.94,1:06:57.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't even take any ammunition.\NHe was totally out of his goddamn mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.24,1:09:58.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.07,1:08:30.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo is doing what he believes\Nhe must do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.84,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't know if what he's doing is right.\NI don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.52,1:09:00.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...if he'll reach the machine city.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.77,1:06:53.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if he does, I don't know\Nwhat he can do to save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.09,1:06:48.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I do know that as long as there is\Na single breath in his body...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:06.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...he will not give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.37,1:07:18.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And neither can we.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.58,1:15:00.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Temperature's dropping.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.89,1:06:55.23,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.66,1:09:12.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We're over the fields, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.96,1:16:19.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.44,1:08:26.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can feel them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.36,1:11:58.03,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.14,1:06:51.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There's our path. Can you see it?\NThree lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.22,1:27:11.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Power lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.08,1:23:14.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Follow them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.57,1:33:32.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.76,1:25:36.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.71,1:10:07.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:46.52,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.38,1:10:09.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is now a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.52,1:09:45.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The machines will breach\Nthe walls of this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.17,1:08:44.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I recommend that the Council join the other\Nnon-military personnel inside the temple.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.62,1:33:36.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How long do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:55.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Two hours. Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.43,1:08:56.31,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,My men have fortified the entrance\Nwith enough artillery to make our last stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.13,1:08:50.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, there isn't anything more\NI can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.75,1:10:05.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Commander, do you think that\Nwe have any chance of surviving?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I wouldn't\Nask me that question.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.98,1:10:33.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I would ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:55.12,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- He's the one who believes in miracles.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.19,1:34:10.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There. Those mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:10.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.84,1:10:13.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Do you see what's out there?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.82,1:10:35.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If you tell me we'll make it,\NI'll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.31,1:11:46.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.42,1:35:11.47,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.28,1:30:24.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Sentinels.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:19.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,There's too many!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:19.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.93,1:11:03.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I need help here!\N- I can't beat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.73,1:11:56.11,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What do we do?\N- Go up, over them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.64,1:10:17.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- The sky! It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.22,1:15:50.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Then up we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.79,1:27:30.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:40.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Pump the igniter. The ship will start.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:31.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Again. Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.78,1:14:07.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trin?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.78,1:23:04.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trinity?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:07.56,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trinity?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.07,1:12:38.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- I'm here.\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.34,1:17:11.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.37,1:12:47.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.72,1:12:24.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You said we would.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.77,1:08:17.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable, Trin.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.53,1:33:25.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Light everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.14,1:14:26.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Like the whole thing was built of light.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.04,1:10:42.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I wish you could see what I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.42,1:13:01.80,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You've already shown me so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.66,1:12:41.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What is it, Trinity?\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.70,1:10:40.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can't go with you, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.25,1:10:03.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I've gone as far as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.35,1:13:05.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.01,1:14:24.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.65,1:16:08.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.62,1:00:17.50,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.96,1:12:54.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.29,1:12:50.46,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I've done all that I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.40,1:13:55.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Now you have to do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.19,1:11:54.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You have to finish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.61,1:13:24.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You have to save Zion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.34,1:12:59.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.68,1:15:10.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Not without you.\N- Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:22.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.03,1:14:09.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I believe it. I always have.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.55,1:29:46.43,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.74,1:13:27.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Trinity, you can't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.03,1:29:18.45,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.18,1:40:58.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.73,1:13:13.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:08.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You brought me back once.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.96,1:17:02.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.50,1:13:34.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do you remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.85,1:04:05.10,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...on that roof, after you caught me...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.93,1:15:12.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...the last thing I said to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.61,1:13:59.36,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You said, "I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.30,1:13:04.14,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I wish I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.31,1:13:09.48,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That was my last thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.93,1:16:34.22,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I wished I had one more chance...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.22,1:04:43.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...to say what really mattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:48.61,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,To say how much I loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.46,1:13:39.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,How grateful I was for every moment\NI was with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.10,1:11:01.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But by the time I knew how to say\Nwhat I wanted to, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:06.34,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But you brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.98,1:14:36.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You gave me my wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.77,1:13:16.73,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,One more chance to say\Nwhat I really wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:39.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.38,1:28:55.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Once more...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:56.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.91,1:15:31.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get that ammunition where it belongs!\NYou got one chance to get this right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.18,1:28:18.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get that damn thing mounted!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.49,1:23:06.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Hurry.\N- Let's go, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.86,1:22:59.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.93,1:13:43.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...if you're gonna do something,\Ndo it quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.63,1:01:53.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I only ask to say\Nwhat I've come to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.25,1:14:15.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,After that, do what you want,\Nand I won't try and stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.13,1:33:48.09,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.40,1:14:38.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The program Smith has grown\Nbeyond your control.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.27,1:15:16.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He will spread through this city\Nas he spread through the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.59,1:42:08.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You cannot stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.15,1:16:44.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- But I can.\N- We don't need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.07,1:16:11.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We need nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.04,1:15:32.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then I've made a mistake,\Nand you should kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.89,1:15:54.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.94,1:40:19.17,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.38,1:54:35.00,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.06,1:15:59.98,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.45,1:05:10.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.19,1:16:04.94,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And if you fail?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.57,1:29:57.44,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.70,1:54:28.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.70,1:16:14.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He fights for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.01,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Mr. Anderson, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.31,1:16:39.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.98,1:16:42.90,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You like what I've done with the place?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.63,1:16:30.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It ends tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.58,1:14:11.79,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know it does. I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.45,1:16:55.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's why the rest of me\Nis just going to enjoy the show...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.12,1:16:58.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...because we already know\Nthat I'm the one that beats you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.57,1:18:52.65,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it, Mr. Anderson...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.46,1:14:21.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...closing in on you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.31,1:17:18.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.40,1:15:28.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I really should thank you for it.\NAfter all, it was your life...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.71,1:17:51.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...that taught me the purpose of all life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.16,1:17:34.62,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The purpose of life is to end.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.02,1:32:45.69,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why, Mr. Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.37,1:36:23.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why, why, why?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.90,1:18:54.40,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.32,1:48:49.16,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why? Why get up?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.97,1:27:44.81,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why keep fighting?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.04,1:25:18.41,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Do you believe you're fighting\Nfor something?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.76,1:33:15.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,For more than your survival?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.20,1:17:32.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what it is?\NDo you even know?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.27,1:28:33.19,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Is it freedom or truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.80,1:26:08.05,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Perhaps peace? Could it be for love?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.12,1:19:01.75,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Illusions, Mr. Anderson.\NVagaries of perception.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.22,1:17:14.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Temporary constructs\Nof a feeble human intellect...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.36,1:20:20.82,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...trying desperately to justify an existence\Nthat is without meaning or purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.54,0:41:38.92,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And all of them as artificial\Nas the Matrix itself...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.70,1:18:59.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...although only a human mind could\Ninvent something as insipid as love.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.65,1:18:56.28,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You must be able to see it, Mr. Anderson.\NYou must know it by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:53.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You can't win.\NIt's pointless to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.89,1:25:39.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Why, Mr. Anderson, why?\NWhy do you persist?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.32,1:21:00.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Because I choose to.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.51,1:25:32.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is my world! My world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.78,1:23:55.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I've seen this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.00,1:19:03.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,This is it. This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.00,1:20:26.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Yes. You were laying right there,\Njust like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.10,1:29:52.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.42,1:25:22.33,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I stand here, right here,\Nand I'm supposed to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.57,1:32:51.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I say:
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.22,1:22:49.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,"Everything that has a beginning\Nhas an end, Neo."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:44.27,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What? What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.20,2:03:22.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, no. This isn't right.\NThis can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.67,1:25:31.26,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.37,1:20:32.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.05,1:20:42.60,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.69,1:09:07.86,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You were right, Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:14.51,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You were always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.74,1:25:14.66,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.05,1:25:34.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.65,1:18:48.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.16,1:17:36.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,No, it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.43,1:25:40.35,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.90,1:28:32.02,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.19,1:23:01.99,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:21.89,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He saved us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.57,1:28:40.07,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He saved us.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.47,1:28:23.97,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's over! He did it! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.75,1:27:33.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,He did it! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.16,1:30:10.04,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's over! He did it! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.46,1:08:42.13,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- What is it? What happened?\N- Sir, he did it, sir. Neo, he did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:17.30,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,- Did what?\N- He ended the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.56,1:19:31.32,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The machines, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.07,1:20:22.95,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The war is over, sir. The war is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.63,1:33:53.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Zion! Zion!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.37,1:26:39.54,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Zion, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.86,1:30:37.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.45,1:23:50.70,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The war is over!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.58,1:25:25.25,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The war is over!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.14,1:27:49.77,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I have imagined this moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.44,1:28:35.15,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.81,1:27:41.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.30,1:21:22.55,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Neo, wherever you are...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.99,1:27:23.91,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.28,1:52:19.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:27:59.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Well, now. Ain't this a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.88,1:27:34.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,You played a very dangerous game.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.21,1:28:48.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Change always is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.66,1:27:26.71,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Just how long do you think\Nthis peace is going to last?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.45,1:29:24.08,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,As long as it can.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.03,1:22:24.20,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:36.72,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What others?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.66,1:22:26.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,The ones that want out.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.20,1:20:24.74,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Obviously, they will be freed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.03,1:28:02.24,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I have your word?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.79,1:28:10.29,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,What do you think I am? Human?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.46,1:35:52.42,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oracle!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.22,1:28:20.18,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,We were afraid we might not find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.20,1:33:35.37,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Everything's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.26,1:30:23.59,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.13,1:29:00.64,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Just look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.34,1:30:25.85,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.22,1:28:16.93,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.03,1:29:59.53,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,For Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.69,1:32:01.57,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.13,1:29:36.76,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I know he'd love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.48,0:52:19.68,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Will we ever see him again?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.83,1:28:08.21,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I suspect so.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.10,1:59:37.83,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.76,1:29:05.06,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Did you always know?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:03.49,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.70,1:30:08.87,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,But I believed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.75,1:28:46.96,Style_Orig,,0,0,0,,I believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Minden rendben?\N- Nem neked kéne leváltanod!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tudom, de gondoltam beugrom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tetszik, neked ugye?\NSzereted nézni?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:59.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Ne légy nevetséges!\N- Meg fogjuk ölni. Tisztában vagy vele?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:02.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Morpheus úgy véli, ő a kiválasztott.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}És szerinted?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:05.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hogy én mit gondolok, az nem számít.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Szerinted nem ő az, ugye?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Hallottad ezt?\N- Mit?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:11.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Biztos vagy benne, hogy nem hallgatnak le?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Igen, egész biztos.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:15.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jobb, ha megyek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:55.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Ne mozdulj! Rendőrség!\N- Kezet tarkóra!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk! Rajta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,VÁROS SZíVE SZÁLLODA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hadnagy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:20.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fenébe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hadnagy,\Nhatározott parancsot kapott.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nézze, csak a munkámat végzem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:31.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha most megint a szabályokkal\Njön nekem, menjen a francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A saját érdekében utasítottuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak elbírunk egy kislánnyal .
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:45.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Két egységet küldtem fel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:47.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Épp most hozzák le.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:50.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Téved, hadnagy.\NAz emberei már halottak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:20.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rohadttak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, nem tudom hogyan,\Nde bemérték a vonalat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tudom elvágták a vezetéket.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nincs időnk!\NEgy másik vonalon kell jönnöd!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vannak ügynökök?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:32.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Igen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fenébe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Koncentrálj, Trinity!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Van egy telefon a Wells és Lake sarkán.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:40.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sikerülni fog.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Rendben.\N- lndulj!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:45.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem lehet igaz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kelj fel, Trinity!\NKelj  fel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kelj fel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Átjutott!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem számít.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A besúgónk bevált .
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudjuk ki a kiszemeltjük.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A neve Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Végigfuttatjuk a keresőn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Már el is kezdtük.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:39.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,KERESÉS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:42.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,MORPHEUS KIJÁTSZOTTA A RENDŐRÖKET
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,EMBERVADÁSZAT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ébredj, Neo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Mátrix rabja vagy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi a fene?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kövesd a fehér nyulat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Kövesd a fehér nyulat! ''
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kop-kop, Neo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ki az?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:55.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Choi vagyok.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Két órát késtél.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom. Őmiatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvan a pénz?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Két lepedő.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Várjatok!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,LÁTSZAT ÉS LÁTTATÁS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Halleluja!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te vagy a megváltóm!\NA személyes Jézus Krisztusom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:43.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lebuksz, ha használod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:45.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg se történt. Te nem létezel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Helyes!\N- Valami baj van?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kicsit sápadt vagy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A számítógépem, nem. . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:01.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Volt már úgy, hogy nem tudtad,\Nébren vagy-e vagy álmodsz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egyfolytában.\NA neve meszkalin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csakis azzal szállhatsz el.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hagyd a francba a gépet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lazíts egy kicsit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:18.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit szólsz, Dujour?\NNe vigyük magunkkal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:21.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Dehogynem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:24.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem lehet. Holnap dolgozom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Élvezni fogod. ígérem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jól van. Megyek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szervusz, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Honnan tudod a nevem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sokat tudok rólad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ki vagy te?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:16.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A nevem Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:21.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az a Trinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Aki betört az adóhivatal gépébe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az jó rég volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:26.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jesszusom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:27.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi az?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak azt hittem. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:32.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .fiú vagy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A legtöbb fiú azt hiszi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te voltál az a számítógépen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:39.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogyan csináltad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:43.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most csak annyit mondhatok. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy veszélyben vagy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Figyelmeztetni akartalak.\N- Mire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyelnek, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:51.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kik?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyelj csak!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:58.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, hogy kerültél ide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:01.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, hogy mit csinálsz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, miért nem tudsz aludni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:07.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .miért élsz egyedül és\Nmiért ülsz minden éjjel. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a számítógéped előtt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őt keresed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:16.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, mert én is őt kerestem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És amikor megtalált. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .elmondta,\Nhogy valójában nem is őt kerestem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:25.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sokkal inkább egy választ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:28.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy kérdés az,\Nami nem hagy nyugodni minket, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:32.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a kérdés hozott ide téged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod mi a kérdés. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ahogyan én is tudtam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Mi az a Mátrix?''
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A választ odakint találod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Téged is keres.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És meg fog találni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha akarod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Francba francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:13.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem jön ki jól a vezetőséggel, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:17.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Különlegesnek hiszi magát, aki\Na szabályok föIött áll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:20.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nyilvánvalóan téved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a világ egyik vezető\Nszoftvercége. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mert mindenki tudja, hogy\Nrésze az egésznek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:34.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha egy alkalmazottal baj van,\Nbaj van az egész céggel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Választania kell,\NMr.Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vagy időben bejön\Na munkahelyére. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagy új állás után nézhet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:50.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Érthetően beszéltem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen, Mr.Rhineheart. Érthetően.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Thomas Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:05.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Helyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Derűs napot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:37.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Szervusz, Neo!\NTudod, ki vagyok?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:40.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:41.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}lgen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:43.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Régóta kereslek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nem tudom, készen állsz-e,\Nhogy lásd ,amit mutatni akarok.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}De sajnos mindketten\Nkifutottunk az időből.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Már jönnek érted, Neo, és\Nnem tudom, mire készülnek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kik jönnek értem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Állj fel,és nézd meg magad!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Micsoda? Most rögtön?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Igen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:03.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Most.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Csak szép lassan!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A liftnél!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fenébe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:19.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit akarnak tőlem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:23.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nem tudom. De ha nem akarod\Nmegtudni, Menekülj.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Én segítek,\Nde azt kell tenned pontosan, amit mondok.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A szemben levő fülke üres.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:36.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- De ha. . . .\N- Rajta indulj!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maradj ott egy ideig!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:55.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha szólok,\Nmenj a folyosó végére...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,...az utolsó irodába.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lapulj a földre!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indulj!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:21.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remek! Kintről az épület\Nfel van állványozva.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Honnan tudod?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Erre most nincs idő!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:29.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tőled balra van egy ablak.\NMenj oda!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nyisd ki!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:36.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mássz ki a párkányra!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Na ne! Nem megy !\NEz kész őrültség!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:41.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kétféleképpen juthatsz ki az épületből.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:45.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vagy az állványzaton,\Nvagy úgy,hogy ők kísérnek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:49.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}így is, úgy is kockázatos.\NVálassz!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:54.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez örültség!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért másznak ezek rám?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit követtem el?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem vagyok senki.\NNem csináltam semmit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:04.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg fogok dögleni.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az istenit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Képtelenség.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:51.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Amint láthatja, egy ideje már\Nfigyeljük magát, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:55.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy látom hogy maga. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .kettős életet él.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az egyikben maga Thomas A. Anderson. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:05.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .egy tekintélyes szoftvercég\Nprogramozója.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:09.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Van biztosítási száma.\NFizeti az adóját.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sőt. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:16.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .segít a házinéninek\Nkivinni a szemetet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.89,0:18:22.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A másik életét is\Na gép mellett tölti. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:25.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mint ''Neo'', a hacker. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:30.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .aki szinte minden elképzelhető\Nkomputeres bűntényt elkövetett már.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az egyik életének. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:35.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .van jövője.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A másiknak nincs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:45.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őszinte leszek, amennyire\Nlehetséges,Mr.Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:47.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért hoztuk ide. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mert segítségre van szükségünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:57.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudjuk, hogy kapcsolatba lépett\Nmagával egy bizonyos. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .személy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:04.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Aki Morpheusnak:\N''Nevezi magát. ''
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:09.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De bármi, amit tudni vél róla,\Ntévedésen alapul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A különböző hatóságok. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a világ legveszélyesebb\Nemberének tartják.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:19.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A kollégáim. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:22.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .azt gondolják hogy csak\Naz időmet vesztegetem magával.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:26.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De szerintem maga\Njót akar cselekedni.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hajlandóak vagyunk\Ntiszta lapot nyitni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .új lehetőséget adni.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És cseréba csak együttműködésre kérjük. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy törvény elé állíthassunk\Negy ismert terroristát.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Értem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó üzletnek hangzik!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:48.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De jobbat ajánlok.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi van . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha ezt mutatom . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és hagyják, hogy telefonáljak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mr.Anderson. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:06.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .csalódást okozott.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezzel a Gestapós dumával\Nnem tud megijeszteni.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ismerem a jogaimat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:13.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jogom van telefonálni.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És mondja, Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:18.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi értelme telefonálni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:22.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha egyszer képtelen beszélni.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:58.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Segíteni fog nekünk Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akár akarja. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:00.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .akár nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A hívást bemérik.\NSzóval rövid leszek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:07.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ők értek el elöbb,\Nde alábecsülték a fontosságodat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:09.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ha tudnák, amit én...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:11.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... valószínüleg halott lennél.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:16.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem értem miről beszélsz?\NMi. . .? Mi történik velem?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:21.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Te vagy a kiválasztott, Neo.\Nte csupán néhány éve...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:24.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... keresel engem, én\Nviszont egész életemben...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... téged kerestelek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akarsz még találkozni velem?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:31.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akkor menj az Adams Street-i hídhoz!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szállj be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:58.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez meg mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szükséges,hogy megvédjük magunkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:02.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kitől?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:03.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tőled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vedd le az inged!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:07.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Állj meg!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:13.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyelj rám,tökfej!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nincs időnk a kérdezz-felelekre.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:18.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak egy szabály van:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:20.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megszoksz. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:21.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagy megszöksz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:29.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rendben.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérlek, Neo! Bíznod kell bennem!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Miért?\N- Mert már voltál ott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ismered azt az utat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:41.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, hova vezet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:45.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És tudom,hogy nem oda akarsz eljutni.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Apoc, fényt!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:06.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Feküdj oda!\NHúzd fel az inged!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az meg mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.37,0:24:10.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bepoloskáztak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.21,0:24:19.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Próbálj lazítani!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:27.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:29.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.02,0:24:31.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mozog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:34.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.81,0:24:39.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Elveszíted.\N- Dehogyis!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:40.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vigyázat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jézus Isten, hát megtörtént?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megérkeztünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.45,0:25:31.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,haddadjak egy tanácsot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.87,0:25:34.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Légy őszinte!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Többet tud, mint képzelnéd.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.05,0:25:48.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Végre!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Isten hozott!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:54.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mint nyilván kitaláltad. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:55.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .én vagyok Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.69,0:25:58.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megtiszteltetés a számomra.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:25:59.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:01.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te tisztelsz meg engem!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:05.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérlek, foglalj helyet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:21.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gondolom. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .most egy kicsit úgy érzed magad,\Nmint a mesében Alice. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:29.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mikor a nyúl üregébe esett.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Körülbelül.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.93,0:26:34.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen, látom a szemedben.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.14,0:26:38.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy nézel, mint aki\Nelfogadja amit lát. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.69,0:26:40.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mivel azt várja, hogy felébred.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:44.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Furcsa, de majdnem ez az igazság.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:48.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hiszel a sorsban, Neo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:49.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:50.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.99,0:26:53.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jobb az a tudat,\Nhogy én irányítom az életemet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:58.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Pontosan tudom, hogy mire gondolsz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:04.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hadd mondjam el, miért vagy itt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.92,0:27:07.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért, mert tudsz valamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:09.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bár nem tudod megmagyarázni.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.13,0:27:11.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De érzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:14.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Érezted egész életedben.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:18.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Valami zűr van a világgal.\NNem tudod, mi az, csak azt, hogy van.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:21.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mint egy szilánk az agyadban. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:23.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ami megőrjít.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.73,0:27:27.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,ez az érzés hozott el hozzám!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:31.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, miről beszélek?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.70,0:27:35.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrixról?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.54,0:27:39.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akarod tudni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:41.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mi az?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.04,0:27:45.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix mindenütt van.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.17,0:27:47.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Körülvesz minket.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még most, ebben a szobában is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:53.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt látod az ablakon át. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:55.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagy ha bekapcsolod a tévét.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:58.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mindig érzed, mikor munkába mész. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:01.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagy épp templomba. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.31,0:28:04.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mikor befizeted az adódat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:08.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a  világ az, mellyel\Neltakarják a szemed elöl. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.69,0:28:10.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az igazságot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:13.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miféle igazságot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.99,0:28:19.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy egy rabszolga vagy, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.04,0:28:23.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mint mindenki, rabnak születtél. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:28.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .egy börtönben, amelyet\Nnem fognak fel érzékeid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.55,0:28:29.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Börtön. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.09,0:28:31.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az elméd számára.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:40.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sajnos, képtelenség. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:43.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .elmondani,\Nvalójában mi a Mátrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:48.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A saját szemeddel kell látnod.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:00.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez az utolsó esélyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Aztán már nem fordulhatsz vissza.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.46,0:29:04.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha a kéket veszed el:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:08.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A játéknak vége, felébredsz\Naz ágyadban, és azt hiszel. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.54,0:29:10.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amit hinni akarsz.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:11.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ha a pirosat választod:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Maradsz Csodaországban. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.63,0:29:17.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és én megmutatom,\Nmilyen mély a nyúl ürege.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.23,0:29:28.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne feledd. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:32.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amit kínálok, csak az igazság.\NSemmi több.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:47.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyere velem!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:52.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Apoc, van kapcsolat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:53.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mindjárt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:59.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az idő ellenünk dolgozik.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Foglalj helyet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:20.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te is csináltad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:27.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A kapszula a hozzáférés.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:32.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Érzékeli a jeledet, hogy\Nbemérhessük a helyzeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az mit jelent?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.63,0:30:36.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kapcsold be az övet, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.13,0:30:38.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mert Kansasnek. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:39.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vége.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ti voltatok. . .?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:34.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Volt már oIyan, Neo, hogy\Naz álmod valóságnak tűnt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:38.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És mi van, ha\Nsosem ébredhetsz fel?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:40.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogyan különbözteted meg\Naz álmot. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:42.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a valóságtól?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:45.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez lehetetlen!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:46.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:49.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem a valóság?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:54.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Készül a replika.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.92,0:31:55.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még semmi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez hideg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:31:59.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hideg!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.09,0:32:04.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank, jelet kérek!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:07.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fibrillál.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:08.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Apoc, a helyzetét!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.18,0:32:10.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Majdnem bemérve.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.94,0:32:15.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Leáll a szíve.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:16.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bemérve! Megvan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most, Tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.37,0:35:16.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Isten hozott. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.79,0:35:18.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a való világban!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.12,0:35:21.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sikerült, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:23.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megtaláltuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.00,0:35:26.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Remélem, igazad van.\N- Én nem remélem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:28.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Én tudom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.14,0:35:35.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meghaltam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.68,0:35:37.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Épp ellenkezőleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.82,0:35:53.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még sokat kell dolgoznunk rajta.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.78,0:35:55.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit csináltok?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:58.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Újrafejlesztjük az izmaidat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.91,0:36:00.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért fáj a szemem?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még sosem használtad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:07.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Pihenj, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:09.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Választ kapsz mindenre.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.33,0:37:25.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, mi történt velem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:27.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi ez a hely?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.88,0:37:30.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem ''mi'' . Inkább\Nazt kérdezd, ''mikor''?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mikor?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.30,0:37:34.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt hiszed, 1999. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.59,0:37:36.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .de valójában majdnem 2199.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.97,0:37:40.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudom pontosan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:42.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mert én sem tudom igazán.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:45.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És megmagyarázni se tudnám.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:47.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyere velem!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.65,0:37:48.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nézd meg magad!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.48,0:37:51.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a hajóm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:54.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Nebuchadnezzar.\NLégpárnás.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.28,0:37:59.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a fedélzet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.04,0:38:06.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a mag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:08.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,NEBUCHADNEZZAR\NÉPÜLT 2060-BAN
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:12.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Innen adjuk le a kalózjeket,\Nés csatlakozunk a Mátrixra.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.67,0:38:18.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A legénység nagyrészét már ismered.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.85,0:38:25.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Apoc. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.06,0:38:27.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .Switch. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:30.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és Cypher.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.40,0:38:34.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akiket nem ismersz:\NTank és a bátyja, Dozer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.99,0:38:37.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A kicsi mögöttük, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.74,0:38:45.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudni akartad, hogy\Nmi a Mátrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:47.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.27,0:39:09.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Próbálj lazítani!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.73,0:39:16.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez kicsit fura lesz.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.41,0:39:21.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,PÓTMEGHAJTÁS
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.54,0:39:29.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:31.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a Construct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.21,0:39:34.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A töltőprogramunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.59,0:39:37.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tölthetünk bármit, ruhát. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:38.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .felszerelést. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:40.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .fegyvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.93,0:39:42.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akár kiképző szimulátort.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:45.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bármit,amire csak szükségünk  van.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.48,0:39:50.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy program részei vagyunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.19,0:39:53.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tényleg nehéz elképzelni?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.61,0:39:56.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Más a ruhád.\NEltűntek a csatlakozók.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.44,0:39:59.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Más a hajad is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:03.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A jelenlegi külsőd\Na ''maradandó önképed'' .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.95,0:40:06.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A digitális valód\Nlelki kivetülése.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem a valóság?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.83,0:40:15.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi a ''valóság''?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.75,0:40:18.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogyan határoznád meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:20.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha arról beszélsz, mit érzel. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.47,0:40:22.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amit szagolsz, ízlelsz, vagy amit látsz. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.13,0:40:27.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a valóság csupán,\Naz agyad által érzékelt elektronikus jelhalmaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.18,0:40:33.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez az általad ismert világ.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.02,0:40:38.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ahogyan a XX. század végén létezett.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.44,0:40:44.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most már csak része\Negy neuro-interaktív szimulációnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:46.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezt hívjuk Mátrixnak.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.83,0:40:53.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Álomvilágban éltél mostanáig.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.62,0:40:55.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a világ. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:57.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ahogyan ma létezik.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.85,0:41:13.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Isten hozott ''a valóság. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:16.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .sivatagában! ''
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:22.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Töredékesek az információink.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.28,0:41:26.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De amit biztosan tudunk, hogy valamikor\Na XXI. század elején. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.32,0:41:29.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az egész emberiség\Negyütt ünnepelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.83,0:41:34.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csodáltuk önnön nagyszerűségünket,\Nhogy megalkottuk az MI. -t
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:36.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,MI?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.54,0:41:38.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mesterséges intelligencia?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.17,0:41:43.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egyedülálló tudat, mely létrehozta\Na gépek egész faját.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.42,0:41:47.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudjuk, ki mérte az első\Ncsapást, mi vagy ők.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:51.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De azt igen, hogy mi perzseltük fel az eget.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.18,0:41:55.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A napenergia éltette őket.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy vélték,\Nnem képesek fennmaradni. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:02.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .egy olyan gazdag energiaforrás\Nnélkül, mint a Nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.03,0:42:07.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Történelmünk során, csak a gépek\Nsegítségével sikerült fennmaradnunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:13.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A sorsnak úgy tűnik, van azért humorérzéke.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.79,0:42:21.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az emberi test több bioáramot\Ntermel, mint egy 120 V-os akku...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:25.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,és több mint 25 ezer egységnyi hőenergiát.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egyfajta fúzió segítségével. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:34.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a gépek több energiát nyernek,\Nmint amennyire szükségük van.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.90,0:42:42.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vannak mezők  Neo.\NVégtelen mezők. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.90,0:42:46.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ahol az emberi lények,\Ntöbbé nem születnek.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:48.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Termesztik őket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.74,0:42:57.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó ideig el sem akartam hinni.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.58,0:43:00.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azután a saját szememmel láttam:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.59,0:43:03.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Cseppfolyósítják a holtakat. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:06.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy intravénásan táplálhassák az élőket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.34,0:43:11.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ott álltam bámulva ezt a tiszta,\Nelborzasztó precizitást. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:14.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .rájöttem, mennyire nyilvánvaló\Naz igazság.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:19.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy mi a Mátrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Uralom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:26.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix számítógéppel\Ngenerált álomvilág. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:30.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amely ellenőrzése alatt\Ntart bennünket. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:34.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy mi, emberi lények. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezzé váljunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.58,0:43:38.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:41.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezt nem hiszem el!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.29,0:43:43.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez lehetetlen!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.09,0:43:48.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem mondtam, hogy könnyű lesz.\NCsak azt mondtam, igaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.92,0:43:49.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elég!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:51.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Engedj ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.68,0:43:54.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Eressz ki! Ki akarok menni!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Nyugalom, Neo! Nyugalom!\N- Húzzátok ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szedjétek ki belőlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.94,0:44:04.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne érj hozzám!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.69,0:44:06.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Menj innen!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.73,0:44:08.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem hiszek benned.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.94,0:44:10.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem hiszek az egészben.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.40,0:44:11.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:14.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mindjárt kikészül.\N- Lélegezz, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.78,0:44:15.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lélegezz!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.05,0:44:35.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem mehetek vissza, ugye?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.81,0:44:37.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.93,0:44:40.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ha lehetne. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.98,0:44:42.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .valóban visszamennél?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.98,0:44:46.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bocsánatot kell kérnem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.94,0:44:48.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Van nálunk egy szabály.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.78,0:44:52.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem csinálunk ilyet\Negy bizonyos kor után.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:53.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Veszélyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.99,0:44:55.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A tudat nehezen áll át.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.95,0:44:58.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Láttam már ilyet, sajnálom.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.29,0:45:01.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért tettem, amit tettem. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.08,0:45:03.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mert muszáj volt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.97,0:45:16.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Amikor megépült a Mátrix,\Nvalaki a belsejében született. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.55,0:45:20.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és képes volt arra, hogy\Nbármit megváltoztasson. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.72,0:45:23.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .úgy formálja, ahogyan akarja.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.40,0:45:28.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ő tette szabaddá az elsőket\Nközülünk. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.73,0:45:31.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .megtanított az igazságra.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.82,0:45:35.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Amíg a Mátrix létezik. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.24,0:45:38.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az ember nem lehet szabad. ''
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.54,0:45:44.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miután ő meghalt. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.83,0:45:47.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .megjövendölték, hogy\Nvisszatér. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és ez lesz a jel, hogy\Na Mátrix elpusztul. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.55,0:45:53.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a háború véget ér. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.55,0:45:54.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és szabadok leszünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:46:00.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezért van az, hogy egy életen át\Nkeresünk a Mátrixban. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.10,0:46:02.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy megtaláljuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:07.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért tettem ezt, mert. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:10.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hiszem: vége a keresésnek.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.03,0:46:17.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Pihenj kicsit!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.07,0:46:19.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szükséged lesz rá.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.79,0:46:23.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mihez?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.87,0:46:27.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A kiképzésedhez.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.18,0:46:47.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó reggelt! Jól aludtál?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.77,0:46:49.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Holnap biztosan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.36,0:46:51.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt garantálom.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.40,0:46:55.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank vagyok, az operátor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.78,0:46:58.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Rajtad nincsenek. . . .\N- Lyukak? Nincsenek.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:03.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A bátyámmal, Dozerrel,\Ntiszta, százszázalékos emberek vagyunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.08,0:47:05.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szabadnak születtünk itt. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.83,0:47:07.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a való világban.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.41,0:47:09.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Zion igazi fia.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:12.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Zion?\N- Ha véget érne a háború. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:14.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .Zionban ünnepelnénk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.55,0:47:15.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az város?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.09,0:47:19.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az utolsó emberi város.\NCsak ez maradt nekünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.84,0:47:22.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hol van?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.85,0:47:24.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A föld alatt. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.10,0:47:27.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .közel a Föld magjához, melegben.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.89,0:47:30.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha sokáig élsz, láthatod is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.02,0:47:37.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Isten szerelmére! Mit mondjak,\Ntényleg izgat, mire vagy képes. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.11,0:47:39.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha Morpheus igazat beszél.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.36,0:47:43.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tilos beszélnünk róla,\Nde. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.37,0:47:44.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha te vagy a kiválasztott. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.87,0:47:47.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .rettentően izgalmaslesz!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.91,0:47:51.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sok a dolgunk.\NLássunk hozzá!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.55,0:47:58.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nos, ezekkel az operációs\Nprogramokkal kéne kezdenünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.47,0:48:02.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De az dögunalmas.\NInkább csináljunk valami szórakoztatóbbat.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.26,0:48:04.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit szólsz egy kis. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.31,0:48:08.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .harci tréninghez?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.11,0:48:15.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Dzsiudzsicu''?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.44,0:48:18.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt fogok tanulni?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.45,0:48:30.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az anyját!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.91,0:48:33.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Úgy látom, ráharapott! ''
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.58,0:48:34.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még egy kicsit?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.13,0:48:36.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jöhet!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:39.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Persze!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:43.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,KEMPO TAE KWON DO\NRÉSZEGES BOKSZ
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.94,0:48:52.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy bírja?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.06,0:48:55.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Már tíz órája. Mint egy gép.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.45,0:49:07.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudok kungfuzni.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.70,0:49:10.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mutasd!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.29,0:49:14.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez egy edzőprogram. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.29,0:49:17.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hasonló a Mátrix\Nprogramozott valóságához.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.34,0:49:19.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ugyanazok az alapszabályok.\NSzabályok,mint a gravitáció
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.71,0:49:23.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,de tudnod kell, hogy ezek a szabályok olyanok\Nmint egy számítógép rendszerben.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.93,0:49:25.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Némelyik megkerülhető.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.64,0:49:26.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A többit...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.72,0:49:28.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,megszegheted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.76,0:49:29.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Világos?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:31.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akkor üss meg. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.43,0:49:33.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha tudsz!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.14,0:50:14.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.35,0:50:15.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Alkalmazkodás.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.81,0:50:17.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rögtönzés.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.31,0:50:18.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De a gyenge pont . .
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.90,0:50:20.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .nem a technikád.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.24,0:50:29.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus verekszik Neóval.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.61,0:51:42.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy tudtalak megütni?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.36,0:51:50.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Túl gyors vagy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:52.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szerinted annak, hogy. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:55.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .erősebb és gyorsabb vagyok. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.45,0:51:59.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .bármi köze van az izmokhoz ezen a helyen?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.17,0:52:04.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt hiszed,most levegőt lélegzel be?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.48,0:52:19.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Újra!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.15,0:52:33.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jesszusom, de gyors!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.82,0:52:36.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neurokinetikai számai messze a normális fölött!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.50,0:52:42.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mire vársz?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.21,0:52:45.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyorsabb vagy ennél.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.38,0:52:49.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne csak hidd!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.84,0:52:51.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudd!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:04.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk! Ne csak próbáld!\NÜss meg!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.61,0:53:16.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem igaz!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.91,0:53:20.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, mit akarsz elérni.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.71,0:53:23.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Felszabadítani a tudatodat, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,de csak az ajtót tudom megmutatni.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.88,0:53:28.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neked kell átmenned rajta.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:33.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank!\NAz ugróprogramot!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.35,0:53:38.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,TÖLTÉS
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:47.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg kell szabadulnod mindtől.\NFélelemtől. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:50.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .kétségtől, hitetlenségtől.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:54.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szabadítsd fel tudatod!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.30,0:54:12.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Oké-zsoké!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.09,0:54:15.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szabad tudat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:16.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És ha sikerül neki?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.09,0:54:19.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Elsőre senkinek sem megy.\N- Tudom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.14,0:54:23.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- De ha neki igen?\N- Nem fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.43,0:54:25.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.52,0:54:26.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jól van.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.15,0:54:29.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Felszabadítom a tudatom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.98,0:54:32.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Felszabadítom. Semmi gond.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:53.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez mit jelent?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.21,0:54:56.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Semmit se jelent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.63,0:54:59.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elsőre mindenki leesik.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.68,0:55:00.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igaz, Trin?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.66,0:55:24.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Szóval valóság volt.\N- A tudatod teszi azzá.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.54,0:55:29.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha megölnek a Mátrixban. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.17,0:55:31.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .itt is meghalsz?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.63,0:55:34.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A test nem élhet tudat nélkül.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.58,0:56:07.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem emlékszem, hogy nekem\Negyszer is kaját hoztál volna.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.04,0:56:13.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Van benne valami,\Nugye?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.50,0:56:16.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak nem váltál hívővé?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:18.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak azon gondolkoztam. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.59,0:56:22.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogyha Morpheus annyira biztos benne,\Nmiért nem viszi el az Orákulumhoz?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.18,0:56:26.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,El fogja vinni,\Nha felkészült.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.90,0:56:37.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix rendszer, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.19,0:56:40.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az a rendszer az ellenségünk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:43.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ha már benne vagy,\Nkörülnézel,mit látsz?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:47.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Üzletembereket, tanárokat,\Nügyvédeket, ácsokat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.95,0:56:50.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg akarjuk menteni a tudatukat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.79,0:56:53.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De addig ők is részei\Na rendszernek. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.00,0:56:55.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagyis ellenségeink.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.29,0:56:57.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még valami:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.55,0:57:00.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Legtöbbjük nem érett még\Nerre a valóságra.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.13,0:57:02.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És legtöbbjük. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.97,0:57:04.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,úgy megszokta...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.14,0:57:05.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,reménytelenül függ a rendszertől. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:08.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,hogy foggal-körömmel védeni fogja.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.85,0:57:13.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyeltél rám vagy\Npiros ruhás nőt bámulod?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.60,0:57:15.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyelj!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.77,0:57:17.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Állítsd meg!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.49,0:57:26.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem a Mátrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:31.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Újabb kiképzőprogram, amiből\Ntanulhatsz valamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.37,0:57:34.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha nem közénk tartozol,\Nakkor közéjük.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.33,0:57:38.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Ők mik?\N- Tudattal rendelkező programok.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:43.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Átjárhatnak a szoftverek között,\Nmégis rendszerük rabjai.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.55,0:57:46.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tehát az, akit\Nnem mi választottunk le. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.26,0:57:48.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .potenciális ügynök.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.56,0:57:51.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrixon belül. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.98,0:57:53.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .lehet, hogy mind az. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:55.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .lehet, hogy egyik sem.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.98,0:57:59.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy maradunk fenn, hogy\Nelbújunk, menekülünk előlük.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:00.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ők őrzik a kapukat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.23,0:58:04.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ők őrznek minden ajtót,\Nnáluk van minden kulcs, úgyhogy. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.45,0:58:07.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .előbb vagy utóbb valakinek\Nmeg kell küzdeni velük.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.66,0:58:08.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Valakinek?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.99,0:58:10.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem hazudok neked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.87,0:58:15.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bárki, aki kiállt ellenük, aki\Nharcba szállt, meghalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:18.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ők még elbuktak,\Nde neked sikerülni fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.75,0:58:19.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.84,0:58:22.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ököllel átütnek egy betonfalat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:25.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egész tárakat lőnek ki rájuk,\Nde nem találják el őket.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.22,0:58:30.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Erejük és gyorsaságuk alapja\Negy szabályokra épült világ.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.10,0:58:32.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Épp ezért. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.47,0:58:35.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .sosem lehetnek olyan\Nerősek és gyorsak, mint te.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.15,0:58:42.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit akarsz ezzel mondani?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.73,0:58:44.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kikerülhetem a golyókat?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.20,0:58:47.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.07,0:58:50.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt akarom mondani,\Nhogy ha kész leszel. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.87,0:58:53.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .már azt sem kell.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.75,0:58:58.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Zűr van!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.48,0:59:18.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Zion riadóztatott?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.10,0:59:19.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.Egy másik hajó.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.19,0:59:24.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fene!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.73,0:59:26.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyors ez a polip.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.78,0:59:27.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Squiddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.82,0:59:31.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őrszem.\NGyilkológép egyetlen feladattal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.28,0:59:32.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kutatni, pusztítani.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.83,0:59:35.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szálljunk le azon a részen!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.81,0:59:57.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi a helyzet?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.49,1:00:07.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Energia zérón.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:10.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,EMP élesítve. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.66,1:00:12.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .tüzelésre kész.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.49,1:00:14.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elektromágneses pulzálás.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.62,1:00:17.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hatástalanít minden\Nelektromos rendszert.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:19.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az egyetlen fegyverünk a gépek ellen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:26.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hol vagyunk?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.84,1:00:28.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A régi közmű hálozatokban.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.43,1:00:31.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csatornák.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.47,1:00:34.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Valaha hatalmas városok voltak itt.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.68,1:00:36.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mostanra már csak ez maradt belőlük.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.85,1:00:38.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csendet!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neo!A frászt hozod rám!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.31,1:01:27.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Bocs.\N- Semmi baj.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.15,1:01:30.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az a. . .?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.24,1:01:32.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:39.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mindig kódolva látod?\N- Nos,muszáj.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.41,1:01:42.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A képátalakítók\Na Construct programon dolgoznak.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:46.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Túl sok az információ, hogy\Ndekódolhassuk a Matrixot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.42,1:01:49.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hozzászoksz majd.\NÉn már nem is látom.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.63,1:01:53.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak szőkéket, barnákat,\Nvöröseket.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.22,1:01:55.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérsz valamit. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.89,1:01:56.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .inni?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.22,1:01:58.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:03.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hidd el. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:05.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .tudom, mire gondolsz.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.98,1:02:08.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mert ugyanarra gondolok.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.40,1:02:11.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tulajdonképpen azóta,\Namióta ideérkeztem.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:16.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért nem a kék kapszulát\Nválasztottam?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.04,1:02:30.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Finom, mi
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.96,1:02:34.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Két dologra jó.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.38,1:02:37.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gépek olajtalanítására és\Nagysejtek elpusztítására.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.47,1:02:40.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérdezhetek valamit?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:45.31,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megmondta neked?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.94,1:02:49.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy miért hozott ide?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.44,1:02:55.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jesszusom!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.40,1:02:58.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Micsoda zűrös ügy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.74,1:03:02.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szóval neked kell\Nmegmentened a világot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:06.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit szólsz hozzá?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:12.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy jó tanács.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.46,1:03:15.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha ügynököt látsz. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.22,1:03:18.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .tedd azt, amit mi:
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.84,1:03:20.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fuss!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:22.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fuss el jó messzire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.73,1:03:31.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kösz az italt!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.15,1:03:37.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szép álmokat!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.32,1:03:44.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akkor megegyeztünk,\NReagan úr?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.41,1:03:46.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudja. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.96,1:03:50.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, ez a szték nem létezik.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.42,1:03:54.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És amikor a számba veszem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.42,1:03:57.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a Mátrix hiteti el az agyammal\Nhogy. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.80,1:03:58.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .szaftos. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.22,1:04:00.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és ízletes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.85,1:04:05.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kilenc év után. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.14,1:04:07.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .tudja, mire jöttem rá?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.53,1:04:16.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A tudatlanság hatalom.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.78,1:04:23.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akkor megegyeztünk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.12,1:04:28.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem akarok emlékezni semmire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:29.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Semmire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.66,1:04:30.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megértették?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.88,1:04:36.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És gazdag akarok lenni.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.01,1:04:40.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Értik, fontos valaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.22,1:04:43.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mondjuk, színész.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.55,1:04:47.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ahogy óhajtja, Reagan úr.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.85,1:04:51.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rendben.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.77,1:04:54.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha visszajuttatnak az erőműbe. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.56,1:04:56.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vissza a Mátrixba. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .meglesz, amit akarnak.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:05:00.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Zion központi rendszerének belépő kódjai.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.57,1:05:02.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mondtam, azokat nem ismerem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.70,1:05:07.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt hozom, aki tudja.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.45,1:05:10.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheust.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.34,1:05:23.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tessék, cimbora.\NA bajnokok reggelije.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:27.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha behunyod a szemed,\Naz íze majdnem igazi.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.18,1:05:29.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy tál takony.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.39,1:05:31.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, mire emlékeztet?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.81,1:05:36.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Tastee Wheatre.\NKóstoltad valamikor?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:38.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem. De valójában te sem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Pont ezt akartam mondani.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:42.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vajon. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.65,1:05:45.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .honnan tudják a gépek,\Nhogy milyen volt az íze.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.16,1:05:47.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hátha tévednek.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.83,1:05:51.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És az igazi Tastee Wheat íze\Nolyan volt. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.33,1:05:53.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mint a tonhalé.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.71,1:05:56.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gondold el!\NPéldául a csirke.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.79,1:05:58.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lehet, hogy nem találták el\Naz ízét. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.05,1:06:01.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezért olyan semmilyen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.34,1:06:03.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Vagy. . . .\N- Fogd be!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:06.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egysejtű fehérje. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .szintetikus aminosavval,\Nvitaminokkal kombinálva.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.76,1:06:11.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ami csak a szervezetnek kell!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.27,1:06:14.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért nekem más is kellene.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.90,1:06:19.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hallom, végigcsináltad\Naz ügynökképző programot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.03,1:06:23.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt én írtam.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:24.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megint kezdi!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.91,1:06:26.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Hogy tetszett?\N- Ki?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.24,1:06:30.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A piros ruhás nő.\NÉn terveztem.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.62,1:06:33.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem egy észlény, de. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.62,1:06:37.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha találkozni akarsz vele,\Nösszehozom egy intim helyen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.83,1:06:39.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nyomul a digitális strici!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.46,1:06:41.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne hallgass ezekre az álszentekre!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha lemondunk a vágyainkról. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.09,1:06:48.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .lemondunk mindenről, ami emberi.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.14,1:06:51.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Dozer, ha végeztél. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.77,1:06:53.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .emelkedj adásmagasságba!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.89,1:06:55.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Behatolunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.94,1:06:57.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elviszem hozzá Neót.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.69,1:07:02.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kihez?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.53,1:07:04.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulumhoz.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:11.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Figyelem, figyelem!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.16,1:07:14.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérem kapcsolják be az öveiket,\NDohányozni tilos a fedélzeten!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.37,1:07:18.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Dőljenek hátra, és\Nélvezzék az utazást!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.28,1:07:44.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bent vagyunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.83,1:08:00.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy órán belül itt vagyunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.77,1:08:17.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hihetetlen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.02,1:08:19.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ugye?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.94,1:08:24.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Uramisten!\N- Mi az?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.44,1:08:26.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt szoktam enni.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.07,1:08:30.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Finom a tészta.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.49,1:08:38.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Emlékek az életemből.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.46,1:08:42.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg sem történtek.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.17,1:08:44.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az mit jelent?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.34,1:08:46.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix nem mondja, ki vagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.46,1:08:48.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulum igen?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.13,1:08:50.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az más.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.43,1:08:56.31,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te jártál nála?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.85,1:08:59.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.52,1:09:00.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit mondott?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.15,1:09:05.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt mondta. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.69,1:09:07.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.66,1:09:12.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt vagyunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyere velem!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:38.31,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szóval az Orákulum,\Ntőle származik. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:39.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a jóslat?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.72,1:09:44.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.Nagyon öreg.\NVelünk van a kezdetétől.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.52,1:09:45.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A kezdetétől?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:46.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mióta ellenállunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.78,1:09:51.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Na és mit tud? Mindent?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:55.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ő úgy mondaná, eleget.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.24,1:09:58.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És sosem téved.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.25,1:10:03.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hagyd az ilyen fogalmakat,\Nmint igaz vagy téves.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.75,1:10:05.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ő eligazít, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.71,1:10:07.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Segít megtalálni az ösvényt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.38,1:10:09.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neked segített?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.84,1:10:13.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit mondott neked?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.64,1:10:17.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy megtalálom a kiválasztottat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.98,1:10:33.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ahogy mondtam,csak az ajtót mutathatom meg.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.82,1:10:35.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neked kell átmenned rajta.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.70,1:10:40.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hello, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.04,1:10:42.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Időben érkeztél.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:54.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Érezd magad otthon, Morpheus!\NNeo, gyere veIem!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.10,1:11:01.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ők a többi jelöltek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.93,1:11:03.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt várj!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.31,1:11:46.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne próbáld meghajlítani!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.23,1:11:49.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az lehetetlen!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.19,1:11:54.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Helyette próbálj rájönni\Naz igazságra!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.73,1:11:56.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Milyen igazságra?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.36,1:11:58.03,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy nincs kanál.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.62,1:12:01.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nincs?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:06.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akkor majd látni fogod, hogy\Nnem a kanál hajlik, hanem te magad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.72,1:12:24.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulum most fogad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.90,1:12:36.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, hogy te vagy Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.07,1:12:38.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mindjárt foglalkozom veled.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:40.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te vagy az Orákulum?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.66,1:12:41.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Talált!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.37,1:12:47.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem egészen ezt vártad, ugye?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.29,1:12:50.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mindjárt kész.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.96,1:12:54.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Finom az illata,nem?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.34,1:12:59.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mondanám, hogy ülj Ie. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.42,1:13:01.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .de úgyse fogsz.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.30,1:13:04.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És ne izgulj a váza miatt!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.35,1:13:05.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Milyen váza?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.31,1:13:09.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az a váza.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.44,1:13:11.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bocsánat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.73,1:13:13.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mondtam, hogy ne izgasson.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.77,1:13:16.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Valamelyik gyerek majd megragasztja.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.36,1:13:18.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Honnan tudtad?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.61,1:13:24.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Később inkább majd\Nazon töröd a fejed:
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.74,1:13:27.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Eltöröd-e akkor is, ha\Nnem szólok?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.50,1:13:34.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csinosabb vagy, mint gondoltam.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.46,1:13:39.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Értem, miért tetszel neki.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.59,1:13:41.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kinek?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.93,1:13:43.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nagy ész azért nem vagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.06,1:13:50.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, miért hozott el Morpheus?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.27,1:13:53.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szóval. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.40,1:13:55.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mit gondolsz?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.61,1:13:59.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szerinted te vagy a kiválasztott?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.32,1:14:02.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őszintén, nem tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.78,1:14:07.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, mit jelent az?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.03,1:14:09.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Latin.Azt jelenti:
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.58,1:14:11.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Ismerd meg önmagadat! ''
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.25,1:14:15.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elárulok neked egy titkot.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.46,1:14:21.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kiválasztottnak lenni olyan,\Nmintha szerelmes volnál.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.01,1:14:24.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Senki se mondhatja meg.\NTe csak tudod. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.14,1:14:26.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .minden porcikád.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.60,1:14:28.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fejed búbjától a lábujjadig.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.18,1:14:32.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nos. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.98,1:14:36.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hadd nézzelek meg jobban!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.40,1:14:38.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nyisd ki a szád,mondd A! ''A'' !
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.29,1:14:54.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rendben.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.58,1:15:00.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most azt kéne mondanom:\N''Érdekes, de. . . . ''
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.05,1:15:02.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mire te:
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.05,1:15:04.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De mi?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:08.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nagyon is tudod már, hogy\Nmit fogok mondani.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.68,1:15:10.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem én vagyok az.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.93,1:15:12.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sajnálom, fiam.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.27,1:15:16.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvan benned a tehetség. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:19.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .de mintha még várnál valamire.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:25.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mire?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.40,1:15:28.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Talán a következő\Néletedre. Ki tudja?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.91,1:15:31.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez már csak így megy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.04,1:15:32.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi olyan vicces?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.29,1:15:34.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:39.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Majdnem meggyőzött engem is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.04,1:15:41.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.71,1:15:44.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szegény Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.22,1:15:50.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nélküle mindnyájan elvesztünk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.89,1:15:54.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi az, hogy ''nélküle''?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.06,1:15:59.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Biztos, hogy hallani akarod?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.19,1:16:04.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus hisz benned, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.65,1:16:08.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És senki, se te,se én nem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.07,1:16:11.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .tudnánk lebeszélni erről.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.70,1:16:14.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Annyira hisz ebben. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.37,1:16:18.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy az életét is feláldozná,\Nhogy megmentse a tiédet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.96,1:16:19.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogyan?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:22.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neked kell majd döntened.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.55,1:16:27.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az egyik oldalon ott lesz\NMorpheus élete.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.63,1:16:30.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A másikon pedig a tiéd.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.93,1:16:34.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egyikőtök meg fog halni.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.31,1:16:39.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy melyikőtök,\Naz rajtad múlik.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.98,1:16:42.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sajnálom, fiú. Igazán.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.15,1:16:44.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó lelek vagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:48.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Utálok jó emberekkel\Nrossz hírt közölni.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:53.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne aggódj!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.45,1:16:55.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mihelyt kilépsz azon az ajtón. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.12,1:16:58.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .jobban fogod érezni magad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.96,1:17:02.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Emlékszel majd, hogy nem hiszel\Nsorsról szóló blablában.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:06.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A saját életed ura te vagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.17,1:17:08.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Emlékszel?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.34,1:17:11.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tessék.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.22,1:17:14.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vegyél egy sütit!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.31,1:17:18.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,ígérem, mire megeszed. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.60,1:17:21.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .kutyabajod se lesz.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.20,1:17:32.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ami elhangzott. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.16,1:17:34.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .csak rád tartozik. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.16,1:17:36.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .senki másra.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.71,1:17:51.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A PIROS RUHÁS NŐ
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.93,1:18:01.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jönnek!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.05,1:18:31.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi ez?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.65,1:18:48.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Óh, déjá vu.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.57,1:18:52.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit mondtál?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.90,1:18:54.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Semmit. Csak déjá vum volt.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.65,1:18:56.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mit láttál?\N- Mi történt?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.70,1:18:59.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy fekete macska ment el ott. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.12,1:19:01.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .aztán egy ugyanolyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.00,1:19:03.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mennyire? Ugyanaz?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.71,1:19:05.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.50,1:19:07.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Switch, Apoc!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.80,1:19:12.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi történt?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:17.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A déjá vu hiba\Na Mátrixban. Ha változtatnak valamin.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.68,1:19:21.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Uramisten!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.35,1:19:24.31,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.56,1:19:31.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elvágták a vezetéket!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.24,1:19:38.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jaj, ne!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.36,1:20:20.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a változás. Csapdába estünk!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.07,1:20:22.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nyugalom! A telefont!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.20,1:20:24.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bemérhetik.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.00,1:20:26.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nincs más választás.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.83,1:20:29.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Operátor.Tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.37,1:20:32.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az épület tervrajzát! Gyorsan!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.05,1:20:42.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Megvan!\N- A közműaknát!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.89,1:20:46.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,8. emelet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.93,1:20:48.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A 8.on vannak.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.81,1:20:50.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egyenesen előre!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.32,1:21:00.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Remélem, jó hírt hallottál.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:10.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most balra! Ez az!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.54,1:21:11.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.30,1:21:22.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hol vannak?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.03,1:22:24.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az aknában!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.66,1:22:26.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az aknában!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.22,1:22:49.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy ügynök!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.86,1:22:59.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ki kell vinnetek Neot!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.19,1:23:01.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak ő számít.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:03.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, ne!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.78,1:23:04.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Trinity, menj!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.49,1:23:06.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Indulás!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.08,1:23:14.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Nem hagyhatjuk!\N- Muszáj!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.27,1:23:41.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.45,1:23:50.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A nagy Morpheus!\N Végre találkozunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.78,1:23:55.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Maga ki?\N- Smith vagyok. Smith ügynök.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:56.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nekem mind egyformák vagytok.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.31,1:24:54.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vigyék!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.82,1:25:09.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Operátor.\N- Kijáratot! Gyorsan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.74,1:25:14.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Baleset volt. Karambol.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.99,1:25:16.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hirtelen, bumm!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.04,1:25:18.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az égiek szeretnek.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:19.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvagy!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.42,1:25:22.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vigyél ki innen! Gyorsan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.58,1:25:25.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Franklin és Erie sarka.\NTévészerelő.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.50,1:25:26.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jó.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.67,1:25:31.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Operátort.\N- Tank, én vagyok az.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.51,1:25:32.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus él?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.05,1:25:34.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus él, Tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.76,1:25:36.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Él. Viszik.\NNem tudom, hova.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.89,1:25:39.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Él. Kijárat kéne.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.43,1:25:40.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Cypher közel van.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.60,1:25:41.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Cypher?\N- Tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:44.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- A Franklin és az Erie sarkán van.\N- Értem.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.37,1:25:54.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvan.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.50,1:26:06.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hol vannak?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.80,1:26:08.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Keresem őket.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.71,1:26:09.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Helyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.44,1:26:24.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Előbb te!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.44,1:26:28.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A fene!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.37,1:26:39.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hirtelen elnémult.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:07.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Halló, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.98,1:27:09.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Cypher! Hol van Tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.91,1:27:15.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:19.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .már régóta. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.99,1:27:23.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .úgy érzem,\Nszerelmes vagyok beléd.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.66,1:27:26.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sokat álmodtam rólad.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.79,1:27:30.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igazán szép vagy, Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.75,1:27:33.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kár, hogy így alakult!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.88,1:27:34.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megölted őket!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:36.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mi az?\N- Istenem!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.97,1:27:38.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Unom már.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.81,1:27:41.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Unom ezt a háborút.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.97,1:27:44.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elegem van a harcból.\NUnom már ezt a hajót. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.14,1:27:49.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .unom a hideget és azt, hogy\Nmindennap moslékot kell ennem.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.19,1:27:53.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De főleg. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.69,1:27:57.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,ebből a faszkalapból és az összes baromságából!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:27:59.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meglepetés, seggfej!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.03,1:28:02.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fogadok, erre nem számítottál.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.49,1:28:03.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ugye?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.83,1:28:08.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Istenem, bár ott lehetnék. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.79,1:28:10.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amikor kicsinálnak.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:14.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bár csak besétálhatnék, éppen akkor.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.22,1:28:16.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rögtön tudnád. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.18,1:28:18.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy én voltam az.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.22,1:28:20.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te adtad fel Morpheust.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:21.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hazudott nekünk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.47,1:28:23.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Átvert bennünket!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.52,1:28:26.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha elmondtad volna az igazat. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.77,1:28:29.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,azt mondtuk volna:\NDugd fel magadnak a piros kapszulát!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.90,1:28:32.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem igaz.\NŐ szabaddá tett bennünket.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.27,1:28:33.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Szabaddá''?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.44,1:28:35.15,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez neked szabadság?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.57,1:28:40.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt teszem, amit ő parancsol.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.66,1:28:44.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha választhatok közte és\Na Mátrix közt. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.75,1:28:46.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a Mátrixot választom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.21,1:28:48.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A Mátrix nem valóság.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.12,1:28:50.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem értünk egyet!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.79,1:28:53.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szerintem a Mátrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.38,1:28:55.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .valóságosabb lehet,\Nmint ez a világ.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.13,1:29:00.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt csak kihúzom ezt a dugót.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.22,1:29:02.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ott. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.76,1:29:05.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,... végig kell nézned,\Nhogy hal meg Apoc.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.81,1:29:14.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,lsten hozott a való világban!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.86,1:29:15.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te kint vagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.03,1:29:18.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Nem mehetsz vissza!\N- Csak képzeled.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.70,1:29:20.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Visszahelyeznek.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.45,1:29:24.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elalszom, és új emberként\Nébredek.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.33,1:29:25.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Különben. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.58,1:29:28.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha valami rém fontosat\Nakarsz mondani Switch-nek. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.04,1:29:30.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,...mondd gyorsan!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.37,1:29:31.25,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kérlek, ne!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.79,1:29:33.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne így!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.13,1:29:36.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem akarok így meghalni!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.22,1:29:42.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Késő.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.64,1:29:44.30,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az isten verjen meg,Cypher!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.55,1:29:46.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne utálj, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.81,1:29:48.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Én csak hírhozó vagyok.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.10,1:29:52.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És mindjárt be is bizonyítom.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.36,1:29:55.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha Morpheusnak igaza volt. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.57,1:29:57.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezt nem leszek képes kihúzni.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.03,1:29:59.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szóval, ha Neo a kiválasztott...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.03,1:30:01.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,...akkor valami csoda...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.11,1:30:04.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .megakadályoz ebben.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:06.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igaz?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.70,1:30:08.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vagyis hogy lehetne ő a kiválasztott. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.16,1:30:10.04,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha meghalt?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.41,1:30:13.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Korábban sosem válaszoltál...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.96,1:30:16.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,...bevetted Morpheus meséjét.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.67,1:30:19.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak annyit szeretnék hallani,\Nigen vagy nem.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.26,1:30:23.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nézz a szemébe!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.34,1:30:25.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Abba a két szép szemébe...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.60,1:30:29.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és válaszolj!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.64,1:30:31.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,lgen...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.23,1:30:33.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,... vagy nem?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.90,1:30:36.02,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.86,1:30:37.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem.Nem hiszem el.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.19,1:30:43.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hiszed vagy nem, te szarházi,\Nakkor is véged!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.63,1:31:03.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Előbb te!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.81,1:31:12.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megsebesültél.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.02,1:31:14.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Rendbe jövök.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.90,1:31:18.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Dozer?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.33,1:31:38.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megálltál valaha bámulni. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.59,1:31:42.71,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .csodálni a szépségét. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.09,1:31:45.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a zsenialitását?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.51,1:31:48.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Emberek milliárdjai. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.64,1:31:51.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .élik le az életüket. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.43,1:31:54.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és nem tudnak róla.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.69,1:32:01.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudtad, hogy az első Mátrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.82,1:32:06.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hibátlan emberi világnak indult,\Namelyben senki se szenved. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.99,1:32:09.91,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és mindenki boldog?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.45,1:32:11.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Katasztrófa volt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:16.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Senki se fogadta el a programot.\NSok embert veszítettünk.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.42,1:32:19.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Néhányuk úgy vélte. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.42,1:32:23.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .nincs programozói nyelvünk, mely\Nleírhatná a tökéletes világot.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:25.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De szerintem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.01,1:32:26.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az emberfajta. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.18,1:32:31.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az emberi lények a valóságot\Na nyomorral és szenvedéssel. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.26,1:32:32.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .határozzák meg.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:35.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A tökéletes világ álom volt. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.85,1:32:40.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .melybőI primitív agyatok\Nfolyton fel akart ébredni.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.02,1:32:45.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezért tervezték át a Mátrixot\Nmai formájára.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.15,1:32:47.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez a csúcsa. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.90,1:32:49.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a civilizációtoknak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.57,1:32:51.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A ''civilizációtoknak'', mondom. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.08,1:32:56.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .mert mihelyt mi gondoltuk el,\Na mi civiIizációnkká vált. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és természetesen épp ez itt\Na lényeg.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.88,1:33:03.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az evolúció, Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.75,1:33:05.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Evolúció.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.38,1:33:09.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mint a dinoszauruszok esetében.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.43,1:33:13.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nézz ki az ablakon!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.76,1:33:15.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lejárt az időtök.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.60,1:33:20.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A jövő a mi világunk,\NMorpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.85,1:33:23.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miénk a jövő.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.49,1:33:28.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lehet egy kis gond.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.57,1:33:32.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mit csinálnak vele?\N- Betörnek a tudatába.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.20,1:33:35.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mint a hackerek. Csak idő kérdése.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.62,1:33:36.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mennyi ideje van?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.08,1:33:40.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A tudatán múlik.\NDe a végén megtörik. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.46,1:33:44.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az alfa hulláma átalakul, ilyenről...\Nilyenre.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.13,1:33:48.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Akkor Morpheus beszélni fog.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.34,1:33:49.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit akarnak tudni?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.63,1:33:53.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Minden hajó vezére megkapja\Na zioni központi terminál kódját.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.93,1:33:56.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha egy ügynök megszerzi\Nés sikerül betörnie oda. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.10,1:34:00.19,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .elpusztít minket.\NEzt nem hagyhatjuk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.02,1:34:02.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Zion fontosabb nálam. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.85,1:34:03.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .nálad. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.11,1:34:05.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .még Morpheusnál is.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.19,1:34:10.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Dehát csak tehetünk valamit!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.28,1:34:13.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Igen. Kihúzzuk a dugót!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.37,1:34:18.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azzal megölöd.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.37,1:34:19.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megölöd Morpheust.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.16,1:34:21.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nincs más választásunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.59,1:34:31.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sose bízd emberre\Na gépek dolgát!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.76,1:34:33.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha leleplezték az emberünket. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.76,1:34:36.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .megszakítják a kapcsolatot,\Namint lehet,különben. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.22,1:34:38.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Halottak. De így  . . .nincs más választásunk
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.18,1:34:42.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A terv szerint kell eljárnunk.\NKüldjék ki az őrszemeket!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.98,1:34:44.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azonnal!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.32,1:34:51.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, több voltál, mint\Nvezérünk.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.95,1:34:55.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az apánk voltál.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.70,1:34:58.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hiányozni fogsz.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.75,1:35:06.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Várj!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.96,1:35:09.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez képtelenség!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.42,1:35:11.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Meg kell tennünk.\N- Kell?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.26,1:35:13.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.97,1:35:15.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem lehet véletlen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.72,1:35:16.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Micsoda?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.05,1:35:17.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulum.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.14,1:35:19.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Előre megmondta.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.35,1:35:24.52,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És azt is, hogy\Nnekem kell döntenem.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:26.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miről?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.19,1:35:30.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit csinálsz?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.48,1:35:31.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Visszamegyek.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.03,1:35:33.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem engedem.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.53,1:35:34.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Muszáj.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.57,1:35:38.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus feláldozta magát, hogy\Ntéged kihozhassunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.45,1:35:40.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem engedlek vissza.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.95,1:35:44.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus azért tette,mert másnak vél,\Nmint aki vagyok.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.46,1:35:49.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem én vagyok az, Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.46,1:35:52.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Az Orákulum megmondta.\N- Csakis te lehetsz.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.67,1:35:55.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sajnálom. Én csak egy\Negyszerű srác vagyok.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.01,1:35:57.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem igaz.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.84,1:35:59.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem lehet igaz.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.51,1:36:00.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.89,1:36:08.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez őrültség! Morpheus\Nkatonai őrizet alatt van.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.48,1:36:12.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És ha még be is jutnál valahogy\Nott vannak az ügynökök. Hárman.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.15,1:36:18.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Én is ki szeretném szabadítani,\Nde ez öngyilkosság.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.32,1:36:19.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudom, annak néz ki.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.20,1:36:21.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De nem az.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.37,1:36:23.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudom megmondani, miért nem.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.83,1:36:28.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus hitt valamiben, és\Nezért kész az életét adni.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.79,1:36:31.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Végre megértettem.\NEzért kell odamennem.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.05,1:36:32.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.13,1:36:34.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mert hiszek valamiben.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:35.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miben?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.09,1:36:38.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy vissza tudom hozni.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.78,1:36:57.70,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mi az?\N- Veled megyek.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.99,1:36:58.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.11,1:36:59.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,''Nem''?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.16,1:37:03.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hadd mondjam el, mit gondolok!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.79,1:37:06.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus többet jelent nekem,mint neked.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.50,1:37:10.79,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És ha komolyan meg akarod menteni,\Nszükséged lesz a segítségemre.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.04,1:37:13.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És mivel a rangidős tiszt itt\Nén vagyok. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.34,1:37:16.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha nem tetszik,\Nelmehetsz a fenébe!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.97,1:37:19.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Máshova úgyse mehetnél.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.80,1:37:20.64,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.51,1:37:22.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tölts fel bennünket!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.27,1:37:35.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szeretném megosztani veled\Na felfedezésemet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.98,1:37:37.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt nálatok jöttem rá.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.78,1:37:41.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mialatt osztályozni próbáltam\Na fajotokat. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.03,1:37:44.28,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .rájöttem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.53,1:37:46.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hogy ti nem is vagytok emlősök.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.04,1:37:51.50,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Minden emlős ezen a bolygón. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.83,1:37:56.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ösztönösen egyensúlyra\Ntörekszik a környezetével.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.01,1:37:58.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De ti, emberek, nem.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.38,1:38:02.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Eljuttok egy területre és\Nelszaporodtok. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.18,1:38:07.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .egészen addig, amíg fel nem\Nélitek az erőforrásokat.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.02,1:38:10.10,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak úgy tudtok fennmaradni. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.39,1:38:13.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ha új területre terjeszkedtek.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.78,1:38:21.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Van egy másik organizmus is. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.91,1:38:23.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amely ugyanezt a sémát követi.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.49,1:38:26.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod, melyik az?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.54,1:38:28.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A vírusok.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.70,1:38:32.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az ember\Nragályos kór.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.12,1:38:34.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A bolygó rákfenéje.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.92,1:38:37.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Betegség.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.59,1:38:38.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És mi vagyunk. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.17,1:38:40.55,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .az orvosság.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:42.97,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mire van szükségetek?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.59,1:38:44.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A csodán kívül?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.30,1:38:46.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fegyverre.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.56,1:38:48.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Sok fegyverre.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.40,1:39:03.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még soha senki nem tett ilyet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.16,1:39:07.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azért fog sikerülni.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.16,1:39:13.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Miért nem hat a szérum?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.71,1:39:16.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Talán rosszak a kérdések.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.09,1:39:19.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hagyjatok magunkra!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.92,1:39:23.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.27,1:39:35.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tarts ki, Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.10,1:39:38.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mennek érted.\NMennek már.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.19,1:39:43.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hallasz engem, Morpheus?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.57,1:39:46.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őszinte leszek. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.62,1:39:47.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .hozzád.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.20,1:39:53.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Én. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.71,1:39:55.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .utálom. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.87,1:39:57.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezt a helyet. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.17,1:40:00.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezt az állatkertet. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.71,1:40:01.84,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezt a börtönt. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.09,1:40:05.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .ezt a valóságot,\Nnevezd, aminek akarod.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.51,1:40:07.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudom elviselni.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.55,1:40:10.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A szag miatt.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.81,1:40:13.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha olyasmi egyáltalán létezik.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.02,1:40:17.31,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy érzem,\Nteljesen átitat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.81,1:40:20.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most is. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.36,1:40:21.23,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .érzem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.07,1:40:24.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .a bűzödet.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.36,1:40:28.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És valahányszor megérzem, félek,\Nengem is megfertőz.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.37,1:40:29.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Undorító!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.16,1:40:31.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.70,1:40:36.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ki kell jutnom innen.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.41,1:40:38.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ki kell szabadulnom.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.88,1:40:41.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És a te tudatodban van a kulcs.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.00,1:40:43.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az én kulcsom.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.92,1:40:46.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ha Zion elpusztul,\Nnem kell tovább itt maradnom.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.05,1:40:48.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megértetted?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.97,1:40:50.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szükségem van a kódokra.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.60,1:40:52.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Be kell jutnom Zionba. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.27,1:40:55.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és neked kell megmondanod,\Nhogyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.18,1:40:58.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vagy elmondod. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.31,1:41:00.48,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .vagy meghalsz.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.67,1:41:22.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mutassa a magánál levő\Nfémtárgyakat!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.42,1:41:23.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kulcsok, aprópénz.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.85,1:41:41.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Erősítést!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.98,1:41:43.57,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Küldjetek erősítést!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.59,1:42:08.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Állj!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.56,1:44:24.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit csináltál?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.39,1:44:27.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még nem tudja.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.94,1:44:29.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.54,1:44:45.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,VÉSZLEÁLLíTÓ
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.09,1:44:52.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,ÉLESíT
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.51,1:45:00.01,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Azt hiszem megpróbálják kiszabadítani.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.86,1:45:16.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nincs kanál.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.22,1:45:48.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Intézzétek el őket!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.02,1:45:50.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ismétlem: megtámadtak.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.89,1:46:26.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Trinity, Segíts!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.75,1:46:49.96,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Csak ember!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.04,1:46:52.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezt védd ki!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.22,1:47:06.76,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Hogy csináltad?\N- Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.14,1:47:11.06,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Úgy mozogsz, mint ők.\NMég sosem láttam ilyet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.19,1:47:13.56,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem volt elég gyors.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.31,1:47:17.61,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudod vezetni?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.94,1:47:19.78,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még nem.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.24,1:47:24.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Operátor.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.28,1:47:27.45,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank, pilótaprogram kéne\Negy B-212 helikopterhez!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.91,1:47:29.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Siess!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.13,1:47:38.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Gyerünk!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.85,1:47:54.94,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ne.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.53,1:48:48.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, állj fel!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.32,1:48:49.16,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Állj fel!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.20,1:49:28.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tud átugrani.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.04,1:49:39.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvagy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.98,1:51:29.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tudtam!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.24,1:51:31.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ő az!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.21,1:51:49.42,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Most már elhiszed,\NTrinity?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.34,1:51:56.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulum.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.47,1:51:59.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Azt mondta. . . .\N- Azt mondta. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.22,1:52:01.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .amit hallanod kellett.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.10,1:52:03.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ennyi.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.48,1:52:07.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Előbb vagy utóbb rájössz,\Namire én is:
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.77,1:52:10.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Egy dolog ismerni az utat. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.82,1:52:12.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .és más járni rajta.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.16,1:52:16.36,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Operátor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.28,1:52:19.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Jó hallani a hangodat!\N- Kijárat kéne.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.08,1:52:22.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Már megvan. Metróállomás,\NState és Balboa-sarok.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:36.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az istenit!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.14,1:52:38.35,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bemérve.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.60,1:52:39.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvan a helyzetük.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.93,1:52:42.18,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őrszemek készenlétben.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.89,1:52:45.39,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Add ki a parancsot!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.94,1:52:53.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Még nem jutottak ki.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.12,1:53:06.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Először te, Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.14,1:53:29.44,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Neo, el akarok mondani valamit.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.69,1:53:36.65,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,De félek attól,\Nmit jelent majd.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.24,1:53:43.54,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Minden valóra vált, amit\Naz Orákulum ígért.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.29,1:53:47.83,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ezt kivéve.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.54,1:53:50.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.69,1:54:18.32,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mi történt?\N- Egy ügynök!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.57,1:54:19.40,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Küldj vissza!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.65,1:54:20.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem tudlak.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.53,1:54:24.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mr.Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.70,1:54:28.08,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Fuss, Neo! Fuss!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.38,1:54:35.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mit csinál?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.25,1:54:36.51,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Elkezd hinni végre.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.49,1:55:04.24,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Üres a tára.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.45,1:55:06.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az öné is.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.90,1:55:42.90,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Élvezettel nézem végig a halálát. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.03,1:55:45.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.03,1:56:28.12,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jesszusom, megöli!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.29,1:57:56.41,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hallja, Mr.Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.16,1:58:00.17,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez az elkerülhetetlen hangja.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.75,1:58:06.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A maga halálának a hangja.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.01,1:58:09.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ég önnel, Mr.Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.59,1:58:11.22,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A nevem. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.22,1:58:16.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,. . .Neo!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.51,1:58:50.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mi történt?\N- Elveszítettem.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.88,1:58:52.43,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,RIADÓ
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.22,1:58:54.26,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.65,1:59:08.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Őrszemek!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.86,1:59:11.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Mennyi időnk van?\N- Öt-hat perc.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.16,1:59:15.33,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tank, töltsd fel az EMP-t!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.58,1:59:18.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,- Ő még nem ért vissza.\N- Tudom. Ne félj!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.00,1:59:20.87,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Visszaér.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.12,1:59:23.00,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Lapos vagy magas sarkút?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.25,1:59:26.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mi a fasz?! Az az én telefonom!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.55,1:59:28.13,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ellopta a mobilomat!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.51,1:59:31.34,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Megvan.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.59,1:59:32.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Menekül.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.05,1:59:33.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Varázsló uram!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.34,1:59:35.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hozzon ki innen!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.97,1:59:37.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Régi kijárat.\NWabash és Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.89,1:59:42.73,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A francba!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.37,2:00:06.38,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kéne egy kis segítség!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.00,2:00:09.21,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az ajtó!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.19,2:00:26.69,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bal oldalt!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.61,2:00:28.86,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A másik bal!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.57,2:00:36.82,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,A hátsó ajtó!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.05,2:00:57.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,VÉSZRIADÓ
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.59,2:00:58.72,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Jaj, ne!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.39,2:01:01.89,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Itt vannak!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.67,2:01:31.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vissza fog érni.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.14,2:01:45.27,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Tűzlépcső a sikátor végén.\N303-as szoba!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.76,2:02:19.09,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,HAJÓTEST SÉRÜLT
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.59,2:02:21.47,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Bejutottak!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.01,2:02:24.85,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Siess!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.20,2:03:22.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ez nem lehet...!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.00,2:03:31.37,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nézd meg!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.38,2:03:36.92,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Vége.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.64,2:03:46.05,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Ég önnel, Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.15,2:03:58.11,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Többé már nem félek.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.73,2:04:00.99,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az Orákulum elmondta,\Nhogy szerelmes leszek valakibe.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.16,2:04:06.66,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,És ő lesz a kiválasztott.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.79,2:04:11.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Érted már?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.46,2:04:14.46,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Te nem halhatsz meg.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.04,2:04:17.88,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Az lehetetlen.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.42,2:04:21.59,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mert téged szeretlek.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.43,2:04:25.14,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hallassz engem?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.26,2:04:27.93,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Szeretlek.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.87,2:04:52.95,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Kelj fel!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.96,2:05:02.80,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.74,2:05:30.58,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Hogy csinálta?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.45,2:05:32.49,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Mégis ő az!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.97,2:07:58.68,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tudom, hogy ott vagytok.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.93,2:08:00.77,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Most már érzem.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.18,2:08:02.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tudom, hogy féltek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.23,2:08:04.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Féltek tőlünk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.15,2:08:06.98,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Féltek a változástól.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.23,2:08:09.20,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,RENDSZER HIBA\N{\i1} - Nem ismerem a jövőt.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.94,2:08:12.53,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nem azért jöttem, hogy elmondjam\Nhogyan fog végződni a háború.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.78,2:08:15.74,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Azért jöttem, hogy elmondjam, hogyan kezdődik.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.70,2:08:18.29,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leteszem ezt a telefont.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.54,2:08:21.62,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}És megmutatom az embereknek,\Namit ti eltitkoltok előlük.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.87,2:08:23.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Megmutatom nekik milyen a világ...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.00,2:08:25.75,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...nélkületek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.04,2:08:29.67,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Szabályok, ellenőrzés,\Nhatárok és korlátok nélküli világot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.92,2:08:33.63,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Egy világot, ahol minden lehetséges.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.26,2:08:37.60,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hogy utána hogyan folytatjuk?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.85,2:08:39.81,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Az csak rajtatok múlik.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.70,2:09:27.07,Style_Dub,,0,0,0,,Magyar szöveg:\NNightWalker
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.93,0:00:50.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Are you all right?\N- You shouldn't be relieving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know, but I thought I'd drop by.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:56.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You like it, don't you?\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:59.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- Don't be ridiculous!\N- We will kill him. Do you realize that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:02.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Morpheus believes he is the chosen one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And what do you think?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:05.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I think doesn't matter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't think it's him, do you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.45,0:01:09.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{Hallottad ezt?\N- Mit?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:11.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you sure you won't be overheard?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:13.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, I'm sure.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.95,0:01:15.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd better go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:55.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Don't move! Police!\N- Hands on your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:56.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,CITY CUSTOMER LODGES
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:20.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, you have specific orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:31.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you're going to be the rule book again, go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have instructed it for its own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We can only manage one little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:45.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I sent up two units!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:47.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They're bringing it down right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:50.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Lieutenant.\NAz's men are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:20.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, I don't know how, but they've got the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know they cut the wire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We don't have time!\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Are there agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:32.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{ "auth_ref".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{Concentral, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a phone on the corner of Wells and Lake.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:40.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- All right.\N- Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:45.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This cannot be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Trinity!\NWake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It got through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.75,0:06:15.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Our informer worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We know who our target is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A neve Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:25.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We run it through the search engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:39.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,SEARCH
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:42.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,MORPHEUS OUTSMARTED THE POLICE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,PUBLICATION
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:13.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ébredj, Neo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a prisoner of the Matrix.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:38.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Follow the white rabbit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''Follow the white rabbit!''
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Header head, Neo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.85,0:07:55.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am Choi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:09.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're two hours late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know. Because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you have the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Two sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:18.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,APPEARANCE AND VISION
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hallelujah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are my saviour!\NA personal Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:43.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You get caught if you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:45.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It never happened. You do not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Good!\N- Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You look a little pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,My computer, no. . . .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:01.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you ever not known if you were awake or dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,All the time.\NA is called mescaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Leave the machine alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Relax a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:18.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Dujour?\No, shall we take him with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:21.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:24.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You can't. I'm working tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You will enjoy it. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:40.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:08.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hello, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.70,0:10:15.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:16.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And I don't know Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.75,0:10:18.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:21.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Is that Trinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Who hacked into the IRS computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:26.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:27.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I just thought. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:32.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .you're a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:34.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Most boys think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It was you on the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:39.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:43.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,All I can say now is. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.81,0:10:45.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .that you are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- I wanted to warn you.\N- About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They're watching, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:51.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Kik?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:58.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know how you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:01.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know why you can't sleep. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:07.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..why you live alone and\Why you sit up every night. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . in front of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:12.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's who you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:16.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know, because I was looking for him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And when he found me. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:22.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...he told me that I wasn't really looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:25.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Rather, an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.86,0:11:28.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,One question is, Neo, this is what keeps us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:32.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the question that brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.41,0:11:35.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know what the question is. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . as I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:40.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,"What is the Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The answer is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He's looking for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And it will find you. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...ha akarod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:13.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're not getting along with management, Mr. Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:17.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He thinks he's special, he's above the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:20.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are obviously wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:25.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is one of the world's leading software companies. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . because everyone knows that they are part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:34.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If one employee is in trouble, the whole company is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:39.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to choose, Mr Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Or get to work on time. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:47.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . or look for a new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:50.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have I made myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr.Rhineheart. Understandably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Thomas Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.33,0:13:05.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:14.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have a serene day!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.32,0:13:37.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you know who I am?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:40.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:41.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{ "i1}lgen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:43.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been looking for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know if you're ready to see what I have to show you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But unfortunately we both ran out of time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're coming for you, Neo, and I don't know what they're up to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:56.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Who is coming for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get up and see for yourself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{ "auth_ref".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:03.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Most.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:05.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just slowly!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At the lift!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:19.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do they want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:23.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know. But if you don't want to know, run.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll help you,{\i1}but you have to do exactly what I say.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The opposite booth is empty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:36.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- De ha. . . Rajta indulj!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay there for a while!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:55.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,When I tell you, go to the end of the corridor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,...to the last office.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get down on the ground!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.57,0:15:03.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indulj!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:21.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remek! It is scaffolded from the outside.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:25.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No time for that now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:29.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is a window to your left.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.89,0:15:33.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take it out!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:36.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Climb out onto the ledge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:38.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No way! I can't !\NEt's crazy !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:41.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are two ways to get out of the building.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:45.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or on the scaffolding,\i0}or with them accompanying you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:49.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{It's risky either way.Choose!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:54.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.54,0:15:57.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why are they climbing on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I am nobody.\NNever did anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:04.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:36.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:57.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:51.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we've been watching you for some time, Mr Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:55.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I see that you are. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .is living a double life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In one of them, Thomas A. Anderson himself. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:05.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . a programmer at a prestigious software company.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:09.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have an insurance number.\NYou pay your taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:11.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In fact. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:16.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .helps the landlady take out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.89,0:18:22.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The other spends his life at the computer. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.31,0:18:25.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .mint ''Neo'', a hacker. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:30.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .who has committed almost every conceivable computer crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.62,0:18:33.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,One of his life. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.83,0:18:35.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...has a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The other does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:45.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I will be as honest as I can be, Mr.Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:47.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's why we brought it here. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .because we need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:57.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We know that you have contacted\Nmagua one particular. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:04.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He calls himself Morpheus.''
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:09.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But anything you think you know about him is based on a misconception.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The different authorities. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:15.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .is considered the most dangerous\Nman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:19.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,My colleagues. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:22.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . they think I'm wasting my time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:26.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But I think you want to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We are willing to come clean. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:32.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .a new opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And in exchange, we only ask for cooperation. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:39.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .to bring one known terrorist to justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a good deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:48.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But I recommend better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mi from . .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...if I show you this... .
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .and let me make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mr. Anderson. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:06.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:09.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You can scare me with that Gestapo talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:11.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know my rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.72,0:20:13.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I have the right to make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And say, Mr Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:18.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is the point of phoning. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:22.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .once he's unable to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:58.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mr Anderson will help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Whether you want to. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:00.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The call will be traced.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:07.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They got there first, but they underestimated your importance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:09.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If they knew what I know...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:11.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... you'd probably be dead.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:16.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NMi. . .? What is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:21.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are the chosen one, Neo.\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.39,0:22:24.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... you've been looking for me, I've been looking for you all my life...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:26.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I was looking for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you see me again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:31.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then go to the Adams Street bridge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:58.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We need to protect ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.22,0:23:02.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,From whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:03.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,From you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:06.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Take off your shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:07.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:13.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There is no time for questions and answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:18.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There is only one rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:20.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You get used to it. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:21.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .or you'll run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:29.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Please, Neo! You have to trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Because you've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:41.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:45.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And I know that's not where you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Apoc, light!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:06.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Lie down over there!\NPull up your shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:09.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.37,0:24:10.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They have been bugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.21,0:24:19.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Try to relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.97,0:24:27.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:29.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.02,0:24:31.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:34.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.81,0:24:39.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- You're losing it.\N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.36,0:24:40.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:51.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ, it's happened!!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.45,0:25:31.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,let me give you a piece of advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.87,0:25:34.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Be honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.12,0:25:38.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He knows more than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.05,0:25:48.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:54.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As you obviously guessed. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:55.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I am Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.69,0:25:58.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is an honour for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:25:59.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.36,0:26:01.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You honour me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.57,0:26:05.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:21.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Gondola. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.21,0:26:24.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...now you feel a bit like Alice in the story. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:29.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .when he fell down the rabbit hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,About.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.93,0:26:34.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.14,0:26:38.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You look as if you\Need to accept what you see. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.69,0:26:40.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .because he expects to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:44.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Strange, but it's almost true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:48.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you believe in fate, Neo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:49.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:50.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.99,0:26:53.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is better to know that I am in control of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:58.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:04.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.92,0:27:07.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because you know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:09.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You can't explain it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.13,0:27:11.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But you can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:14.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You've felt it all your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.80,0:27:18.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with the world.\You don't know what it is, only that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.48,0:27:21.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Like a splinter in your brain. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:23.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .which drives me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.73,0:27:27.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,this feeling brought me to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.03,0:27:31.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.70,0:27:35.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,About the Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.54,0:27:39.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Akarod also. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:41.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.04,0:27:45.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.17,0:27:47.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Even now, in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:53.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You can see it through the window. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:55.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . or if you turn on the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:58.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You always feel it when you go to work. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:01.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . or to church. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.31,0:28:04.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . when you pay your taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:08.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the world that is hidden from your eyes. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.69,0:28:10.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:13.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.99,0:28:19.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That you are a slave, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.04,0:28:23.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Like everyone, you were born a prisoner. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.58,0:28:28.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..in a prison, which you will be able to sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.55,0:28:29.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Prison. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.09,0:28:31.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . for your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.22,0:28:40.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it is impossible. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:43.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . to tell you what the Matrix really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.73,0:28:48.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to see it with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:00.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:03.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then you can't turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.46,0:29:04.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you take the blue one:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:08.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The game is over, you wake up in your bed and you think. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.54,0:29:10.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . whatever you want to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:11.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But if you choose the red one:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You stay in Wonderland. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.63,0:29:17.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..and I'll show you how deep the rabbit hole is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.23,0:29:28.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ne feledd. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:32.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . what I offer is just the truth.\Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:47.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:52.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Apoc, is there a connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:53.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.13,0:29:59.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Time is working against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:20.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:27.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The capsule is access.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:32.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It senses your signal so that we can understand your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.00,0:30:34.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.63,0:30:36.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fasten your seat belt, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.13,0:30:38.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mert Kansasnek. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:39.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:19.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It was you. . .?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:34.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you ever had a dream, Neo, that seemed like reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.61,0:31:38.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And what if you never wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:40.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How you distinguish\Naz dream. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:42.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .from reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:45.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.08,0:31:46.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.70,0:31:49.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Not reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.17,0:31:54.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A replica is being made.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.92,0:31:55.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.38,0:31:57.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.84,0:31:59.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.09,0:32:04.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tank, give me a signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.30,0:32:07.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fibrillation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.39,0:32:08.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Apoc, your position!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.18,0:32:10.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Almost locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.94,0:32:15.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,His heart stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.61,0:32:16.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Traced! Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now, Tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.37,0:35:16.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Welcome to. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.79,0:35:18.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . in the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.12,0:35:21.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You did it, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:23.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.00,0:35:26.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- I hope you are right.\N- I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:28.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.14,0:35:35.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.68,0:35:37.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,On the contrary!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.82,0:35:53.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We still have a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.78,0:35:55.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.12,0:35:58.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We will rebuild your muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.91,0:36:00.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why do my eyes hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:03.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You've never used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.00,0:36:07.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Blow, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.09,0:36:09.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You get answers to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.33,0:37:25.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, what happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:27.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.88,0:37:30.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Not "we" . Inkább\No, ask "when"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.25,0:37:32.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.30,0:37:34.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You think, 1999. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.59,0:37:36.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . but it's actually almost 2199.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.97,0:37:40.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.97,0:37:42.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:45.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:47.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.65,0:37:48.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,See for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.48,0:37:51.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.53,0:37:54.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Nebuchadnezzar.\NLégpárnás.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.28,0:37:59.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.04,0:38:06.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:08.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,NEBUCHADNEZZAR\BUILT IN 2060
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:12.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,From here we drop off the pirates,\and join the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.67,0:38:18.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You already know most of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.85,0:38:25.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Apoc. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.06,0:38:27.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .Switch. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.98,0:38:30.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .és Cypher.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.40,0:38:34.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The ones you don't know:\NTank and his brother Dozer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.99,0:38:37.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The little one behind them, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.74,0:38:45.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You wanted to know how the Matrix works.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:47.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.27,0:39:09.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Try to relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.73,0:39:16.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a bit weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.41,0:39:21.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,SUBMISSION
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.54,0:39:29.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ez. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:31.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .a Construct.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.21,0:39:34.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Our charger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.59,0:39:37.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We can load anything, clothes. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:38.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .equipment. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:40.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.93,0:39:42.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Like a training simulator.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:45.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Anything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.48,0:39:50.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Are we part of a programme?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.19,0:39:53.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Is it really hard to imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.61,0:39:56.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are different.\The connectors have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.44,0:39:59.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Your hair is different too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:03.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Your current külsőd\Na ''permanent self-image''.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.95,0:40:06.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Projection of digital power\Next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.46,0:40:13.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.83,0:40:15.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is ''reality''?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.75,0:40:18.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How would you define it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:20.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you talk about how you feel. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.47,0:40:22.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . what you smell, taste, or see. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.13,0:40:27.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..reality is just a set of electronic signals perceived by your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.18,0:40:33.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the world as you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.02,0:40:38.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As it existed at the end of the 20th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.44,0:40:44.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now it's just part of a neuro-interactive simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:46.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We call this the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.83,0:40:53.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have been living in a dream world until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.62,0:40:55.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the world. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:57.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . as it exists today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.85,0:41:13.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Welcome to ''the reality. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.69,0:41:16.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . in the desert!''
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.65,0:41:22.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Our information is fragmentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.28,0:41:26.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But what we do know for sure is that something happened in the early 21st century. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.32,0:41:29.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...all of humanity celebrated together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.83,0:41:34.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We admired our own greatness,\How we created the AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.37,0:41:36.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,MI?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.54,0:41:38.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Artificial intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.17,0:41:43.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A unique consciousness that creates a whole race of machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.42,0:41:47.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We do not know who measured the first attack, us or them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:51.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But we did burn up the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.18,0:41:55.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Solar energy kept them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They felt they could not survive. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.27,0:42:02.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .with an energy source as rich as the Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.03,0:42:07.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Throughout our history, we have only managed to survive with the help of machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:13.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fate, it seems, has a sense of humour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.79,0:42:21.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The human body produces more bioelectricity\Nter than a 120 V battery...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:25.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,and more than 25 thousand units of thermal energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:29.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Through a kind of fusion. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:34.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..the machines gain more energy than they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.90,0:42:42.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There are fields Neo.\NInfinite fields. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.90,0:42:46.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . where human beings are no longer born.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.86,0:42:48.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They grow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.74,0:42:57.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For a while I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.58,0:43:00.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then I saw it with my own eyes:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.59,0:43:03.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They liquefy the dead. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:06.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .to feed the living intravenously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.34,0:43:11.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I stood there staring at the sheer, \uncanny precision. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:14.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I realised how obvious the truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.39,0:43:19.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is the Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Uralom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:26.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix is a computer-generated dream world. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:30.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . which is under our control\Ntart. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:34.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .that we, human beings. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.04,0:43:36.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .this is what we become.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.58,0:43:38.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:41.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.29,0:43:43.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.09,0:43:48.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I didn't say it would be easy.\NI just said it was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.92,0:43:49.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Eleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.76,0:43:51.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.68,0:43:54.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let me out! I want out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.56,0:43:59.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Relax, Neo! Calm down!\N- Pull him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.48,0:44:01.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get it out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.94,0:44:04.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.69,0:44:06.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Menj innen!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.73,0:44:08.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.94,0:44:10.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.40,0:44:11.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.16,0:44:14.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- He's going to freak out.\N- Breathe, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.78,0:44:15.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.05,0:44:35.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I can't go back, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.81,0:44:37.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.93,0:44:40.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But if you could. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.98,0:44:42.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .would you really go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.98,0:44:46.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I must apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.94,0:44:48.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.78,0:44:52.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We don't do that after a certain age.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:53.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.99,0:44:55.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is difficult for the mind to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.95,0:44:58.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I've seen it before, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.29,0:45:01.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I did what I did because. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.08,0:45:03.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .because I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.97,0:45:16.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,When the Matrix was built, \Nvalaki was born inside it. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.55,0:45:20.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . and was able to change everything. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.72,0:45:23.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .you can shape it any way you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.40,0:45:28.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He set our capital free. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.73,0:45:31.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...taught me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.82,0:45:35.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''As long as the Matrix exists. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.24,0:45:38.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...man cannot be free.''
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.54,0:45:44.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,After he died. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.83,0:45:47.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...predicted to be\Nvisszatér. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . and it will be the signal that\Na Matrix is destroyed. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.55,0:45:53.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . the war is over. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.55,0:45:54.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . and we will be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:46:00.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's why we spend a lifetime in the Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.10,0:46:02.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.10,0:46:07.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I did this because. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:10.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...I think the search is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.03,0:46:17.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get some rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.07,0:46:19.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You will need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.79,0:46:23.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.87,0:46:27.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.18,0:46:47.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Good morning! Did you sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.77,0:46:49.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.36,0:46:51.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.40,0:46:55.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm Tank, the operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.78,0:46:58.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Not on you. . . .\N- Holes? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.11,0:47:03.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,My brother Dozer and I are pure, one hundred percent human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.08,0:47:05.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We were born free here. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.83,0:47:07.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.41,0:47:09.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The true son of Zion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:12.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Zion?\N- If the war would end. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:14.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .we would celebrate in Zion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.55,0:47:15.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The city?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.09,0:47:19.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is the last human city.\NThat is all we have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.84,0:47:22.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hollow of?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.85,0:47:24.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Under the ground. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.10,0:47:27.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .close to the Earth's core, warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.89,0:47:30.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you live long enough, you can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.02,0:47:37.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For God's sake! What can I say,\I'm really excited about what you can do. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.11,0:47:39.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .if Morpheus is telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.36,0:47:43.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We are not allowed to talk about it,\Nde. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.37,0:47:44.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . if you are the chosen one. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.87,0:47:47.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .will be terribly exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.91,0:47:51.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to do.Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.55,0:47:58.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Well, we should start with these operating\N programs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.47,0:48:02.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But that's boring.\N Let's do something more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.26,0:48:04.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How about a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.31,0:48:08.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .harci traininghez?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.11,0:48:15.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''Dzhiujicu''?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.44,0:48:18.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Will I learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.45,0:48:30.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.91,0:48:33.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''I see he's bitten it!''
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.58,0:48:34.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.13,0:48:36.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.71,0:48:39.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Persze!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:43.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,KEMPO TAE KWON DO\PARTICULAR BOXING
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.94,0:48:52.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.06,0:48:55.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's been ten hours. Like a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.45,0:49:07.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I can kung fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.70,0:49:10.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mutasd!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.29,0:49:14.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is a training programme. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.29,0:49:17.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . similar to the reality of the Matrix\Nprogrammed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.34,0:49:19.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Same basic rules.\Nrules as gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.71,0:49:23.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,but you should know that these rules are like a computer system.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.93,0:49:25.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Some can be bypassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.64,0:49:26.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.72,0:49:28.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,you can break.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.76,0:49:29.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.02,0:49:31.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then hit me. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.43,0:49:33.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.14,0:50:14.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jó!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.35,0:50:15.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Adaptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.81,0:50:17.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Improvisation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.31,0:50:18.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But the weak point . .
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.90,0:50:20.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...dumb and technical.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.24,0:50:29.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus is fighting with Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.61,0:51:42.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How could I hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.36,0:51:50.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:52.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you think that. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:55.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I am stronger and faster. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.45,0:51:59.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . anything to do with the muscles in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.17,0:52:04.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You think you're breathing air now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.48,0:52:19.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.15,0:52:33.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jeez, that was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.82,0:52:36.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,His neurokinetic numbers are way above normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.50,0:52:42.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.21,0:52:45.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're faster than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.38,0:52:49.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't just believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.84,0:52:51.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tudd!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:04.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on! Don't just try it!\NYou can try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.61,0:53:16.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.91,0:53:20.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.71,0:53:23.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Free your mind, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,but I can only show you the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.88,0:53:28.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:33.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tank!\NAz jumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.35,0:53:38.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,DOWNLOAD
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:47.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to get rid of it all.\NFear. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.06,0:53:50.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .from doubt, disbelief.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:54.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Free your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.30,0:54:12.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.09,0:54:15.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Free consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:16.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And if he succeeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.09,0:54:19.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Nobody does it the first time.\N- I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.14,0:54:23.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- But if he does?\N- He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.43,0:54:25.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.52,0:54:26.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.15,0:54:29.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I free my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.98,0:54:32.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm releasing it. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:53.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.21,0:54:56.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.63,0:54:59.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Everyone falls at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.68,0:55:00.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Right, Trin?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.66,0:55:24.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- So it was real.\N- Your mind makes it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.54,0:55:29.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you get killed in the Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.17,0:55:31.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .will you die here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.63,0:55:34.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The body cannot live without consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.58,0:56:07.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you ever bringing me food.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.04,0:56:13.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There's something in it, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.50,0:56:16.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you become a believer?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.13,0:56:18.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.59,0:56:22.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...if Morpheus is so sure, why not take him to the Oracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.18,0:56:26.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He'll take it, if he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.90,0:56:37.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix system, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.19,0:56:40.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That system is our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.11,0:56:43.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But once you're in, look around, what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.70,0:56:47.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Businessmen, teachers, lawyers, carpenters.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.95,0:56:50.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We want to save their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.79,0:56:53.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But until then they are part of the system. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.00,0:56:55.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.29,0:56:57.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,One more thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.55,0:57:00.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Most of them are not yet ready for reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.13,0:57:02.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And most of them. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.97,0:57:04.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,so used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.14,0:57:05.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,hopelessly dependent on the system. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:08.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,that he will defend it tooth and nail.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.85,0:57:13.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you been listening to me or staring at a woman in a red dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.60,0:57:15.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.77,0:57:17.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.49,0:57:26.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.91,0:57:31.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Another training programme to learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.37,0:57:34.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you are not one of us, you are one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.33,0:57:38.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- They are what?\N- Conscious programmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:43.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They can move between software, but they are still prisoners of their system.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.55,0:57:46.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So the one we almost voted out. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.26,0:57:48.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .a potential agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.56,0:57:51.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Inside the Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.98,0:57:53.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...maybe they all are. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.02,0:57:55.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . maybe neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.98,0:57:59.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We stay up, we stay up, we run away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:00.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But they guard the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.23,0:58:04.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They guard all the doors, they have all the keys, so. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.45,0:58:07.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...sooner or later someone has to fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.66,0:58:08.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.99,0:58:10.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.87,0:58:15.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Anyone who stood up to them, who fought them, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:18.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They have failed, but you will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.75,0:58:19.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.84,0:58:22.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A fist is driven through a concrete wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:25.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They fire whole rounds at them, but they don't hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.22,0:58:30.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Their power and speed are the foundation of a world built on rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.10,0:58:32.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's why. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.47,0:58:35.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...can never be as strong and fast as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.15,0:58:42.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.73,0:58:44.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Can I dodge bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.20,0:58:47.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.07,0:58:50.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I want to say, "When you're ready. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.87,0:58:53.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...you don't even need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.75,0:58:58.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Zűr of!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.48,0:59:18.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Did Zion sound the alarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.10,0:59:19.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No.Another boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.19,0:59:24.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.73,0:59:26.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This octopus is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.78,0:59:27.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Squiddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.82,0:59:31.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sentinel.\NKilling machine with a single task.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.28,0:59:32.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,To investigate, to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.83,0:59:35.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let's land in that part!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.81,0:59:57.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is the situation?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.49,1:00:07.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Energy at zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:10.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,EMP armed. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.66,1:00:12.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.49,1:00:14.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Electromagnetic pulsing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.62,1:00:17.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Disable all\electric systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.75,1:00:19.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Our only weapon against the machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.75,1:00:26.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.84,1:00:28.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In the old utility networks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.43,1:00:31.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Channels.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.47,1:00:34.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There were once huge cities here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.68,1:00:36.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now that's all that's left of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.85,1:00:38.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Csendet!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Neo!You scared the hell out of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.31,1:01:27.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Sorry.\N- It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.15,1:01:30.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Az a. . .?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.24,1:01:32.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:39.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Do you always see it in code?\N- Well, you have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.41,1:01:42.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The image converters\Na Construct are working on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.75,1:01:46.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Too much information to decode the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.42,1:01:49.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it.\Now I can't even see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.63,1:01:53.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Only blondes, browns,\reds.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.22,1:01:55.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You want something. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.89,1:01:56.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...others?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.22,1:01:58.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:03.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hidd el. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.19,1:02:05.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.98,1:02:08.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because I think the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.40,1:02:11.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In fact, ever since I arrived here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.65,1:02:16.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I choose the blue capsule?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.04,1:02:30.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Finns, me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.96,1:02:34.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It does two things.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.38,1:02:37.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For de-oiling machinery and\To destroy large cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.47,1:02:40.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:45.31,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.94,1:02:49.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.44,1:02:55.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.40,1:02:58.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What a messy business!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.74,1:03:02.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So you have to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:06.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:12.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.46,1:03:15.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you see an agent. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.22,1:03:18.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .do what we do:
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.84,1:03:20.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.72,1:03:22.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Run far away!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.73,1:03:31.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the drink!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.15,1:03:37.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.32,1:03:44.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So we have a deal, Mr Reagan?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.41,1:03:46.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.96,1:03:50.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know, this steak does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.42,1:03:54.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And when I put it in my mouth. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.42,1:03:57.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .the Matrix makes my brain believe that. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.80,1:03:58.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . .szaftos. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.22,1:04:00.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.85,1:04:05.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,After nine years. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.14,1:04:07.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...you know what I found out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.53,1:04:16.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ignorance is power.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.78,1:04:23.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.12,1:04:28.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't want to remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:29.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.66,1:04:30.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.88,1:04:36.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And I want to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.01,1:04:40.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They understand, someone is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.22,1:04:43.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Say, an actor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.55,1:04:47.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Mr Reagan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.85,1:04:51.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.77,1:04:54.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you are returned to the power plant. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.56,1:04:56.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .back to the Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .they'll get what they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.32,1:05:00.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Zion's central system access codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.57,1:05:02.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't know those.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.70,1:05:07.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'll bring the one who knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.45,1:05:10.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheust.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.34,1:05:23.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here you go, buddy.\NA breakfast of champions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:27.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you close your eyes, it tastes almost real.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.18,1:05:29.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A bowl of snot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.39,1:05:31.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know what it reminds me of?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.81,1:05:36.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tastee Wheatre.\NHave you ever tasted it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:38.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No. But neither do you, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.73,1:05:40.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I was going to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:42.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I wonder. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.65,1:05:45.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . how do the machines know what it tasted like.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.16,1:05:47.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Maybe they are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.83,1:05:51.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And the real Tastee Wheat was íze\Nolyan. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.33,1:05:53.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .like tuna.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.71,1:05:56.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Think about it!\NFor example, chicken.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.79,1:05:58.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Maybe they couldn't find the taste of el\Naz. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.05,1:06:01.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .that's why it's so nonexistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.34,1:06:03.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Vagy. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:06.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Single-cell protein. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..combined with synthetic amino acids,\Nvitamins.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.76,1:06:11.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Just what the organisation needs!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.27,1:06:14.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I need something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.90,1:06:19.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I hear you've been through the agent training program.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.03,1:06:23.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I wrote that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:24.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here we go again!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.91,1:06:26.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- How did you like it?\N- Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.24,1:06:30.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I designed it on the woman in red.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.62,1:06:33.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He's no genius, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.62,1:06:37.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...if you want to meet him, I'll bring him together in an intimate place.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.83,1:06:39.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The digital pimp is pushing!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.46,1:06:41.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to these hypocrites!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.01,1:06:44.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If we give up our desires. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.09,1:06:48.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .we give up everything that is human.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.14,1:06:51.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Dozer, when you're done. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.77,1:06:53.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .rise to broadcast height!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.89,1:06:55.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We are entering.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.94,1:06:57.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'll take Neo to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.69,1:07:02.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,To whom?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.53,1:07:04.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,To the Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.28,1:07:11.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Attention, attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.16,1:07:14.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Please fasten your seat belts, no smoking on board!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.37,1:07:18.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sit back, relax and enjoy the ride!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.28,1:07:44.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.83,1:08:00.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We'll be here in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.77,1:08:17.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.02,1:08:19.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ugye?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.94,1:08:24.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Oh my God!\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.44,1:08:26.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I eat here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.07,1:08:30.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The pasta is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.49,1:08:38.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Memories from my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.46,1:08:42.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.17,1:08:44.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.34,1:08:46.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix does not tell you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.46,1:08:48.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Is the oracle?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.13,1:08:50.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's different.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.43,1:08:56.31,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you been to see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.85,1:08:59.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.52,1:09:00.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.15,1:09:05.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He said. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.69,1:09:07.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.66,1:09:12.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.24,1:09:15.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:38.31,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So the oracle, it comes from him. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.64,1:09:39.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .the prediction?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.72,1:09:44.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yes.It's very old.\NWe've had it from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.52,1:09:45.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,From the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:46.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Since we have been resisting.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.78,1:09:51.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So what does it know? Everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:55.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He would say enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.24,1:09:58.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And he's never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.25,1:10:03.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Forget such concepts,\such as true or false.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.75,1:10:05.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He'll show you the way, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.71,1:10:07.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It helps you find the path.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.38,1:10:09.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Did it help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.84,1:10:13.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.64,1:10:17.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,To find the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.98,1:10:33.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As I said, I can only show you the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.82,1:10:35.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to go through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.70,1:10:40.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hello, Neo!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.04,1:10:42.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.63,1:10:54.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home, Morpheus!\NNeo, come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.10,1:11:01.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They are the other candidates.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.93,1:11:03.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Wait here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.31,1:11:46.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't try to bend it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.23,1:11:49.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.19,1:11:54.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Instead, try to find out the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.73,1:11:56.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.36,1:11:58.03,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That there is no spoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.62,1:12:01.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:06.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then you will see that it is not the spoon that bends, but you yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.72,1:12:24.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Oracles are now welcoming you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.90,1:12:36.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know you're Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.07,1:12:38.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:40.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Are you the Oracle?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.66,1:12:41.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.37,1:12:47.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what you expected, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.29,1:12:50.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.96,1:12:54.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Smells good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.34,1:12:59.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I would say sit Ie. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.42,1:13:01.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . but you won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.30,1:13:04.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And don't worry about the vase!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.35,1:13:05.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What vase?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.31,1:13:09.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That vase.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.44,1:13:11.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.73,1:13:13.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I told him not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.77,1:13:16.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,One of the kids will grab it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.36,1:13:18.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.61,1:13:24.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Later, you'll be thinking about it:
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.74,1:13:27.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Will you still break it if I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.50,1:13:34.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're prettier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.46,1:13:39.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I can see why he likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.59,1:13:41.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Kinek?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.93,1:13:43.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're not very bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.06,1:13:50.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you know why Morpheus took me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.27,1:13:53.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.40,1:13:55.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.61,1:13:59.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you think you are the chosen one?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.32,1:14:02.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.78,1:14:07.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.03,1:14:09.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Latin.It means:
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.58,1:14:11.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''Know thyself!''
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.25,1:14:15.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'll let you in on a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.46,1:14:21.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Being chosen is like being in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.01,1:14:24.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No one can tell you.\You just know. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.14,1:14:26.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .every inch of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.60,1:14:28.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,From the top of your head to your toes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.18,1:14:32.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nos. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.98,1:14:36.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...let me have a better look at you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.40,1:14:38.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Open your mouth, say A! ''A''!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.29,1:14:54.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.58,1:15:00.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now I should say: 'It's interesting, but... . ''
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.05,1:15:02.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mire te:
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.05,1:15:04.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The mi?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.30,1:15:08.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You already know what I'm going to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.68,1:15:10.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.93,1:15:12.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.27,1:15:16.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have the talent. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.27,1:15:19.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .but it's like you're waiting for something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:25.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mire?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.40,1:15:28.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Maybe your next\life. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.91,1:15:31.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.04,1:15:32.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.29,1:15:34.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:39.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It almost convinced me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.04,1:15:41.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.71,1:15:44.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Poor Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.22,1:15:50.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Without it, we are all lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.89,1:15:54.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "without"?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.06,1:15:59.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.19,1:16:04.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus believes in you, Neo.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.65,1:16:08.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And no one, not you or me. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.07,1:16:11.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .we could talk him out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.70,1:16:14.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He believes in it so much. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.37,1:16:18.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...that he would sacrifice his life to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.96,1:16:19.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:22.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You will have to decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.55,1:16:27.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,On one side there will be the life of \Norpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.63,1:16:30.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And on the other, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.93,1:16:34.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,One of you will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.31,1:16:39.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Which one of you, it's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.98,1:16:42.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sorry, boy. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.15,1:16:44.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are a good soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:48.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I hate to give good news about people\Nros.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:53.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.45,1:16:55.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,As soon as you walk out that door. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.12,1:16:58.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . you will feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.96,1:17:02.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You'll remember that you're not in a blurb about hiszel\Nsorsors.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:06.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are the master of your own life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.17,1:17:08.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.34,1:17:11.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.22,1:17:14.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Buy a cookie!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.31,1:17:18.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I promise, by the time you eat it. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.60,1:17:21.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...kutyabajod se leš.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.20,1:17:32.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What was said. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.16,1:17:34.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .is your business. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.16,1:17:36.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .no one else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.71,1:17:51.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,THE WOMAN IN RED
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.93,1:18:01.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jönnek!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.05,1:18:31.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.65,1:18:48.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Oh, déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.57,1:18:52.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.90,1:18:54.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nothing. It was just déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.65,1:18:56.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What did you see?\N- What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.70,1:18:59.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A black cat went by there. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.12,1:19:01.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .and then one of the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.00,1:19:03.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How much? The same?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.71,1:19:05.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.50,1:19:07.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Switch, Apoc!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.80,1:19:12.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.88,1:19:17.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The deja vu bug\Na Matrix. If they change something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.68,1:19:21.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.35,1:19:24.31,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.56,1:19:31.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They cut the wire!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.24,1:19:38.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.36,1:20:20.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the change. We are trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.07,1:20:22.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Calm down! The phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.20,1:20:24.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They can locate.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.00,1:20:26.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There is no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.83,1:20:29.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Operator.Tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.37,1:20:32.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The blueprint of the building! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.05,1:20:42.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Got it!\N- The utility shaft!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.89,1:20:46.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,8th floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.93,1:20:48.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They are on the 8th.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.81,1:20:50.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.32,1:21:00.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I hope you have heard good news.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.75,1:21:10.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now left! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.54,1:21:11.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jó.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.30,1:21:22.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.03,1:22:24.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In the manhole!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.66,1:22:26.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In the manhole!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.22,1:22:49.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,An agent!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.86,1:22:59.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to get Neo out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.19,1:23:01.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Only he matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.32,1:23:03.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.78,1:23:04.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Trinity, menj!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.49,1:23:06.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.08,1:23:14.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- We can't let them!\N- We have to!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.27,1:23:41.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.45,1:23:50.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The great Morpheus!\N We meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.78,1:23:55.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- I'm Smith. Agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:56.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You all look alike to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.31,1:24:54.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Take him!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.82,1:25:09.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Operator.\N- Exit! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.74,1:25:14.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It was an accident. A collision.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.99,1:25:16.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, boom!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.04,1:25:18.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The heavens love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.66,1:25:19.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.42,1:25:22.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.58,1:25:25.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The corner of Franklin and Erie.\NTelevision.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.50,1:25:26.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jó.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.67,1:25:31.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Operator.\N- Tank, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.51,1:25:32.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus is alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.05,1:25:34.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus is alive, Tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.76,1:25:36.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I live. They're taking him.\I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.89,1:25:39.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I live. You should get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.43,1:25:40.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Cypher is close.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.60,1:25:41.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- Cypher?\N- Tudom.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:44.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- It's on the corner of Franklin and Erie.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.37,1:25:54.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.50,1:26:06.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.80,1:26:08.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.71,1:26:09.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.44,1:26:24.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You first!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.44,1:26:28.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.37,1:26:39.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Suddenly it went silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.35,1:27:07.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hello, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.98,1:27:09.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Cypher! Hollow of Tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.91,1:27:15.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tudod. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.66,1:27:19.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . a long time ago. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.99,1:27:23.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...I feel, \I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.66,1:27:26.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I dreamed a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.79,1:27:30.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are really beautiful, Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.75,1:27:33.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Too bad it turned out like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.88,1:27:34.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You killed them!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:36.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.97,1:27:38.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Unom már.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.81,1:27:41.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I am tired of this war.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.97,1:27:44.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of fighting.\NI'm tired of this ship. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.14,1:27:49.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..I'm sick of the cold and having to eat slop every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.19,1:27:53.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But mostly. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.69,1:27:57.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,from this fucking hat and all its bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.20,1:27:59.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Surprise, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.03,1:28:02.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I bet you didn't expect that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.49,1:28:03.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ugye?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.83,1:28:08.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,God, I wish I could be there. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.79,1:28:10.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .when they kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:14.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I wish I could just walk in, right then.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.22,1:28:16.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You would know right away. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.18,1:28:18.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . that it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.22,1:28:20.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You gave up Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:21.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She was lying to us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.47,1:28:23.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.52,1:28:26.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If you had told the truth. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.77,1:28:29.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,we would have said: \Nstuff yourself with the red capsule!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.90,1:28:32.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's not true.\WOMAN has set us free.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.27,1:28:33.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,"Free"?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.44,1:28:35.15,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Is that freedom for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.57,1:28:40.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I do as he commands.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.66,1:28:44.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Given the choice between him and\Na Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.75,1:28:46.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I choose the Matrix.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.21,1:28:48.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Matrix is not reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.12,1:28:50.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We disagree!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.79,1:28:53.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I think the Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.38,1:28:55.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...can be more real, \like this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.13,1:29:00.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm just pulling this plug here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.22,1:29:02.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But there. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.76,1:29:05.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,... you have to see how Apoc dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.81,1:29:14.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the real world!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.86,1:29:15.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You're out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.03,1:29:18.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- You can't go back!\N- You're imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.70,1:29:20.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You will be reinstated.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.45,1:29:24.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I fall asleep and wake up as a new man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.33,1:29:25.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Otherwise. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.58,1:29:28.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .if you want to say something really important to Switch. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.04,1:29:30.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,...tell me quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.37,1:29:31.25,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.79,1:29:33.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Not like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.13,1:29:36.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.22,1:29:42.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.64,1:29:44.30,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,God damn you, Cypher!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.55,1:29:46.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Don't hate me, Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.81,1:29:48.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm just a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.10,1:29:52.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And I'm about to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.36,1:29:55.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If Morpheus was right. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.57,1:29:57.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I won't be able to pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.03,1:29:59.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So, if Neo is the chosen one...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.03,1:30:01.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,...then some miracle...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.11,1:30:04.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .prevents me from doing so.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:06.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.70,1:30:08.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I mean, how could he be the chosen one. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.16,1:30:10.04,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .if he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.41,1:30:13.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You never answered before...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.96,1:30:16.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,...you bought Morpheus' story.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.67,1:30:19.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,All I want to hear is, yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.26,1:30:23.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Look into his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.34,1:30:25.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,In those two beautiful eyes...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.60,1:30:29.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . and answer!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.64,1:30:31.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,lgen...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.23,1:30:33.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,... or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.90,1:30:36.02,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.86,1:30:37.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No.I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.19,1:30:43.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, you son of a bitch, you're finished!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.63,1:31:03.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You first!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.81,1:31:12.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You are wounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.02,1:31:14.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.90,1:31:18.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Dozer?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.33,1:31:38.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Have you ever stopped to stare. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.59,1:31:42.71,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .to admire its beauty. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.09,1:31:45.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .his genius?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.51,1:31:48.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Billions of people. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.64,1:31:51.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...live their lives. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.43,1:31:54.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . and they don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.69,1:32:01.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Did you know that the first Matrix. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.82,1:32:06.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...began as a flawless human world, \in which no one suffers. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.99,1:32:09.91,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . and everyone is happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.45,1:32:11.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It was a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.20,1:32:16.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nobody accepted the programme.\NSo many people were lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.42,1:32:19.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Some of them thought. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.42,1:32:23.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . we have no programming language to describe the perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:25.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But I think. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.01,1:32:26.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .the human race. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.18,1:32:31.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..human beings are reality\Na with misery and suffering. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.26,1:32:32.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...are determined by.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.89,1:32:35.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,A perfect world was a dream. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.85,1:32:40.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .from which his primitive mind was constantly trying to awaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.02,1:32:45.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's why the Matrix was redesigned in its current form.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.15,1:32:47.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the tip. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.90,1:32:49.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .for your civilization.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.57,1:32:51.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,For your "civilisations", I say. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.08,1:32:56.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . because as soon as we thought about it, it became our civilization. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.45,1:32:59.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..and that, of course, is the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.88,1:33:03.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Evolution, Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.75,1:33:05.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.38,1:33:09.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Like dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.43,1:33:13.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Look out the window!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.76,1:33:15.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Your time is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.60,1:33:20.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The future is our world, \NMorpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.85,1:33:23.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The future is ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.49,1:33:28.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There may be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.57,1:33:32.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What are they doing to him?\N- They're breaking into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.20,1:33:35.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Like hackers. It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.62,1:33:36.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How long do you have?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.08,1:33:40.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's up to your mind.\But in the end it will break. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.46,1:33:44.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .the alpha wave is transformed from. . . to something like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.13,1:33:48.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Then Morpheus will speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.34,1:33:49.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do they want to know?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.63,1:33:53.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Each ship's captain will receive the code for the central terminal in Zion.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.93,1:33:56.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If an agent gets in there. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.10,1:34:00.19,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ..it will destroy us.\NE cannot let it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.02,1:34:02.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Zion is more important than me. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.85,1:34:03.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...moods. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.11,1:34:05.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .even Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.19,1:34:10.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But there must be something we can do!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.28,1:34:13.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's pull the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.37,1:34:18.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.37,1:34:19.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You kill Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.16,1:34:21.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.59,1:34:31.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Never leave it to humans\The machines!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.76,1:34:33.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If our man has been exposed. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.76,1:34:36.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...they will disconnect you, as they might otherwise. . . .
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.22,1:34:38.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The dead. But this way... ..we have no choice
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.18,1:34:42.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We must proceed according to plan.\NSend out the sentries.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.98,1:34:44.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.32,1:34:51.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, you were more than our leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.95,1:34:55.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You were our father.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.70,1:34:58.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I will miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.75,1:35:06.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.96,1:35:09.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.42,1:35:11.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have to do it.\N- Should we?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.26,1:35:13.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.97,1:35:15.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This cannot be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.72,1:35:16.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.05,1:35:17.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.14,1:35:19.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He told me in advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.35,1:35:24.52,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And also that I have to decide for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.98,1:35:26.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.19,1:35:30.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.48,1:35:31.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.03,1:35:33.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.53,1:35:34.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.57,1:35:38.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus sacrificed himself to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.45,1:35:40.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.95,1:35:44.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus did it because he thinks I'm different from who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.46,1:35:49.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's not me, Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.46,1:35:52.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- The Oracle said.\N- Only you can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.67,1:35:55.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm just a guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.01,1:35:57.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.84,1:35:59.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It cannot be true.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.51,1:36:00.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.89,1:36:08.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is crazy! Morpheus\He is under military custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.48,1:36:12.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And even if you get in somewhere, the agents are there. Three of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.15,1:36:18.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I want to free him too, but it's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.32,1:36:19.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I know, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.20,1:36:21.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But it is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.37,1:36:23.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I cannot say why not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.83,1:36:28.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus believed in something, and\Nez was ready to give his life for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.79,1:36:31.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I finally understood.\NE why I have to go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.05,1:36:32.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.13,1:36:34.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because I believe in something.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:35.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Miben?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.09,1:36:38.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,So I can bring it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.78,1:36:57.70,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.99,1:36:58.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.11,1:36:59.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,''Nem''?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.16,1:37:03.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what I think!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.79,1:37:06.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus means more to me than to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.50,1:37:10.79,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And if you're serious about saving her, you're going to need my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.04,1:37:13.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And as the senior officer here. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.34,1:37:16.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...if you don't like it, you can go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.97,1:37:19.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.80,1:37:20.64,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.51,1:37:22.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fill us up!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.27,1:37:35.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I would like to share my discovery with you\Na.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.98,1:37:37.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I found out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.78,1:37:41.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,While I was trying to classify your race. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.03,1:37:44.28,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .I figured it out. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.53,1:37:46.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . that you are not mammals.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.04,1:37:51.50,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Every mammal on this planet. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.83,1:37:56.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. ...instinctively balances with its environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.01,1:37:58.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But not you people.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.38,1:38:02.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You come to an area and\You multiply. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.18,1:38:07.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . until you use up the resources.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.02,1:38:10.10,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It is the only way you can survive. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.39,1:38:13.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .if they expand into new territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.78,1:38:21.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,There is another organism. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.91,1:38:23.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . which follows the same pattern.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.49,1:38:26.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you know which one it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.54,1:38:28.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The viruses.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.70,1:38:32.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The man with the disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.12,1:38:34.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The cancer bottom of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.92,1:38:37.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.59,1:38:38.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And we are. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.17,1:38:40.55,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .the medicine.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.55,1:38:42.97,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.59,1:38:44.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Besides the miracle?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.30,1:38:46.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,To arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.56,1:38:48.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Many weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.40,1:39:03.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No one has ever done that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.16,1:39:07.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But it will work.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.16,1:39:13.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Why does the serum not work?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.71,1:39:16.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Maybe the questions are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.09,1:39:19.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.92,1:39:23.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.27,1:39:35.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Morpheus!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.10,1:39:38.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They are coming for you.\NThey are coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.19,1:39:43.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Morpheus?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.57,1:39:46.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I will be honest. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.62,1:39:47.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.20,1:39:53.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Én. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.71,1:39:55.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...by the uthal. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.87,1:39:57.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .this place. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.17,1:40:00.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .this zoo. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.71,1:40:01.84,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .this prison. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.09,1:40:05.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . this reality, call it what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.51,1:40:07.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I cannot bear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.55,1:40:10.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because of the smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.81,1:40:13.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If there is such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.02,1:40:17.31,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I feel completely imbued.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.81,1:40:20.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Most is. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.36,1:40:21.23,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . ...the era. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.07,1:40:24.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .your stench.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.36,1:40:28.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And every time I smell it, I'm afraid,\I'm infected too.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.37,1:40:29.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.16,1:40:31.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.70,1:40:36.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ki kell jutnom innen.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.41,1:40:38.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I need to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.88,1:40:41.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And in your mind is the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.00,1:40:43.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,My key.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.92,1:40:46.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,If Zion is destroyed, I don't have to stay here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.05,1:40:48.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.97,1:40:50.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I need the codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.60,1:40:52.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I need to get into Zion. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.27,1:40:55.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . and you have to tell me how.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.18,1:40:58.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Or you can tell me. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.31,1:41:00.48,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . or you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.67,1:41:22.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Show me the metal objects you have on you!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.42,1:41:23.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Keys, change.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.85,1:41:41.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Backup!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.98,1:41:43.57,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Send reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.59,1:42:08.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.56,1:44:24.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.39,1:44:27.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.94,1:44:29.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.54,1:44:45.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,SUPPLEMENT
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.09,1:44:52.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Read more
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.51,1:45:00.01,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I think they're trying to get him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.86,1:45:16.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,No spoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.22,1:45:48.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.02,1:45:50.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I repeat: I was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.89,1:46:26.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Trinity, Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.75,1:46:49.96,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Only human!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.04,1:46:52.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Defend this!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.22,1:47:06.76,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- How did you do it?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.14,1:47:11.06,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You move like them.\NI've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.19,1:47:13.56,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It was not fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.31,1:47:17.61,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Can you drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.94,1:47:19.78,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.24,1:47:24.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Operator.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.28,1:47:27.45,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tank, pilot program for two B-212 helicopters!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.91,1:47:29.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Siess!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.13,1:47:38.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.85,1:47:54.94,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Ne.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.53,1:48:48.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Morpheus, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.32,1:48:49.16,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.20,1:49:28.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You can't jump over.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.04,1:49:39.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.98,1:51:29.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.24,1:51:31.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.21,1:51:49.42,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Now do you believe me, Trinity?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.34,1:51:56.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Oracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.47,1:51:59.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- He said. . . .\N- He said. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.22,1:52:01.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . .you needed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.10,1:52:03.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.48,1:52:07.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll find out,\as I did:
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.77,1:52:10.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to know the way. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.82,1:52:12.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . . and others walk on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.16,1:52:16.36,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Operator.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.28,1:52:19.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- It's good to hear your voice!\N- I should get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.08,1:52:22.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I've got it. Metro station,\NState and Balboa corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:36.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.14,1:52:38.35,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Measured.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.60,1:52:39.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,We have their position.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.93,1:52:42.18,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sentries on standby.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.89,1:52:45.39,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Give the order!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.94,1:52:53.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They are not out yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.12,1:53:06.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You first, Morpheus.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.14,1:53:29.44,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Neo, I want to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.69,1:53:36.65,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,But I am afraid of what it will mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.24,1:53:43.54,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Everything the Oracle promised has come true.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.29,1:53:47.83,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Except this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.54,1:53:50.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mit?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.69,1:54:18.32,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- An agent!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.57,1:54:19.40,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Send me back!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.65,1:54:20.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.53,1:54:24.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.70,1:54:28.08,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Foot, Neo! Foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.38,1:54:35.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.25,1:54:36.51,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You start to believe at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.49,1:55:04.24,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Your cupboard is empty.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.45,1:55:06.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yours too.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.90,1:55:42.90,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I am watching his death with pleasure. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.03,1:55:45.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.03,1:56:28.12,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Jesus, he's killing him!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.29,1:57:56.41,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.16,1:58:00.17,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This is the inevitable sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.75,1:58:06.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The sound of your death.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.01,1:58:09.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I wish you well, Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.59,1:58:11.22,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I don't know. . .
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.22,1:58:16.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,. . Neo!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.51,1:58:50.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.88,1:58:52.43,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,RIADO
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.22,1:58:54.26,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.65,1:59:08.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Sentinels!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.86,1:59:11.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- How much time do we have?\N- Five to six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.16,1:59:15.33,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Tank, charge the EMP!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.58,1:59:18.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,- He's not back yet.\N- I know. Don't be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.00,1:59:20.87,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.12,1:59:23.00,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Flat or high heels?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.25,1:59:26.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?! That's my phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.55,1:59:28.13,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He stole my mobile!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.51,1:59:31.34,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.59,1:59:32.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,He's running away.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.05,1:59:33.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Wizard sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.34,1:59:35.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.97,1:59:37.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Old exit.\NWabash and Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.89,1:59:42.73,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.37,2:00:06.38,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I need some help!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.00,2:00:09.21,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The door!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.19,2:00:26.69,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,On the left!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.61,2:00:28.86,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The other left!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.57,2:00:36.82,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The back door!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.05,2:00:57.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,ADDITION
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.59,2:00:58.72,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.39,2:01:01.89,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.67,2:01:31.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,It will come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.14,2:01:45.27,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Fire escape at the end of the alley.\N303 room!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.76,2:02:19.09,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,HULL DAMAGED
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.59,2:02:21.47,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,They're in!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.01,2:02:24.85,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Siess!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.20,2:03:22.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,This can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.00,2:03:31.37,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.38,2:03:36.92,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.64,2:03:46.05,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I wish you well, Mr. Anderson!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.15,2:03:58.11,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I am no longer afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.73,2:04:00.99,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,The Oracle told me,\I'm falling in love with someone.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.16,2:04:06.66,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,And he will be the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.79,2:04:11.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.46,2:04:14.46,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,You cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.04,2:04:17.88,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,That is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.42,2:04:21.59,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.43,2:04:25.14,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.26,2:04:27.93,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.87,2:04:52.95,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.96,2:05:02.80,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Nem!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.74,2:05:30.58,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.45,2:05:32.49,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Yet it is him!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.97,2:07:58.68,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you're there.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.93,2:08:00.77,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can feel it now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.18,2:08:02.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you are afraid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.23,2:08:04.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They were afraid of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.15,2:08:06.98,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fear of change.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.23,2:08:09.20,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,SYSTEM FAILURE - I do not know the future.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.94,2:08:12.53,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not here to tell you how the war will end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.78,2:08:15.74,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm here to tell you how it starts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.70,2:08:18.29,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm putting this phone down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.54,2:08:21.62,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I will show the people what you are hiding from them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.87,2:08:23.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I show them what the world is like...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.00,2:08:25.75,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...nélkületek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.04,2:08:29.67,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A world without rules, control, boundaries and limits.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.92,2:08:33.63,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A world where anything is possible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.26,2:08:37.60,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How do we proceed afterwards?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.85,2:08:39.81,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's up to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.70,2:09:27.07,Style_Trans,,0,0,0,,Transcript:\NNightWalker
